Xinhua Times Review: Turning excellent returning migrant workers into rural rejuvenation - Xinhua.com
Revitalizing the countryside, talent is the key.
Where are you looking for people?
An excellent group of returning migrant workers is an indispensable force.
Xinhua News Agency Haichun
Xinhua News Agency, Chengdu, July 26th: The construction of outstanding returning migrant workers into rural rejuvenation
The 34-year-old Zhang’s family is in the orchard village of Meishan City in Sichuan, and in 2010, he quit his job with a monthly salary in Beijing and returned home to start a business.
After a few years of hard work, the annual income of the viticultural family farm he runs is more than one million yuan, becoming a well-known wealth leader, and he has also been selected to enter the "two committees" team in the village.
In recent years, inspired by a series of policies such as national poverty alleviation and rural rejuvenation, more and more outstanding migrant workers such as Zhang Xiong have chosen to return home and start a business, which has activated the spring water in the countryside.
China's western province with a large population and labor-exporting province in Sichuan, due to snobbish guidance on the implementation of the "Excellent migrant worker diversion training project", only in 2019, more than 8000 village party branch secretaries were generated from the return of outstanding migrant workers, cultivated 61,000 village reserve forces, and developed more than 20,000 party members, providing a strong guarantee for winning the fight against poverty and implementing the rural revitalization strategy.
It’s not a well-to-do, the key is to look at the villagers.
Since the beginning of reform and opening up, a large number of young and middle-aged laborers in China's rural areas have gone abroad to increase their income, and some have set up their own enterprises through hard work.
However, objectively, it has also led to the emergence of "hollowing" in rural areas to varying degrees, especially the weakening of rural grass-roots organizations, village party branch secretaries and party members are showing the characteristics of â€œone old and one lowâ€ , that is, old age, low education, and the leadership of village party organizations is not strong.
If factors such as rural talents have been flowing to the city in a one-round way, the countryside has long been in a state of "blem loss" and "anemia" for a long time, rejuvenation is an empty phrase.
Those who have the ability, awareness, and are interested in serving their hometown migrant workers are attracted back, guiding them to return to entrepreneurship to become rich leaders, train them into party members and rural cadres, and enrich the grass-roots cadres, which is the fundamental policy to solve the problems of rural party members and grass-roots party organizations.
Excellent migrant workers can be brought back, but also let them stay and do a good job.
In the past few years, on the basis of strict selection criteria, Sichuan has set up institutional mechanisms such as directional diversion, service guarantee, training improvement, selection and use of outstanding migrant workers, so that they can improve their abilities, work security, and life expectations, and truly take root in rural areas, and have a sense of accomplishment in entrepreneurship.
This year is the end of the decisive battle against poverty, to do a good job in the link between poverty alleviation and rural revitalization, talent is the key factor.
Party committees and governments at all levels should attach great importance to the group of outstanding returning migrant workers, and through comprehensive measures, they should be transformed into a task force that can be retained, fought and taken away, providing a strong organizational guarantee and talent support for the well-off and development and revitalization of rural areas.
Because of the epidemic, this year's college graduates are a very special session, on the evening of July 11th, bilibili summer graduation song will bring a special online live performance for the graduates, old wolf, park tree, Li Yuchun, Mao not easy and other musicians to send songs and blessings to the recent graduates.
The well-known up Lord SealWu Wu Yifan also brought a "weed", which is based on Lu Xun's collection of prose poems of the same name to create a rap style song, which is extremely popular among young people.
Due to the relationship of the epidemic, many graduates did not understand the ceremonial sense of on-the-spot and degree certificates, and they transferred the ceremonial feeling online.
According to the data, this 2.5-hour concert has a peak of more than 35 million live popularity.
"Follow your own heart, seize the opportunity, regardless of the consequences, sometimes there will be an unexpected harvest."
Although it is a graduation concert, a lot of songs have also touched non-graduates.
"The whole scene I really want to cry, anyone's youth is full of beauty and regret, but it is worth remembering, we must walk bravely."
Beijing's natural ecology continues to improve, attracting more than 500 kinds of wild animal city "settlement"
2020-07-26 05:03:17 Source:Beijing Youth Daily Author:Wang Sisuo Responsibility Editor:Wang Sisuo
The natural ecology of the capital has continued to improve to attract the "settlement" of wild animal cities.
There are more than 500 kinds of wild animals in Beijing.
The Beijing Youth Daily reporter learned from the Municipal Landscaping Bureau that in recent years, with the continuous improvement of the natural ecological environment of the capital, the types and numbers of wild animals have also continued to increase.
At present, the number of terrestrial vertebrate vertebrate wild animals living in Beijing has increased to more than 500 species, including national-level protected animals such as brown horse chickens and black storks, as well as second-level protected animals such as porcupins, large swans, gray cranes, and ephemerals.
Whether it's planting an urban forest in the second ring or a small and micro-wetland embedded between the buildings, it not only brings the wild fun of nature to the citizens of the capital, but also attracts wild animals to "settlement" in the city.
In the mid-summer season, Songshan National Nature Reserve, which is located in the Yanshan Mountains in the north-western Yanqing District, is vibrant.
One of them was playing in the mountains, and the two dogs were playing with each other.
Looking back, a wild boar can't help but stab the bark on its body. Hu Qiaoli, director of the Songshan National Nature Reserve Management Department, said that by the end of 2019, there were 178 kinds of wild animals, including golden eagles for national-level protected animal sparrows and wildebeests in this green sea with a total area of more than 6,200 hectares.
"In Songshan, wild animals are the real 'masters', and our staff can only be regarded as people's bodyguards at best."
Hu Qiaoli said that in order to understand the wildlife situation in the protected area on the ground, there are more than 30 professional rangers every day, along 16 well-crafted protection routes, and there will be a "turning circle" every month, using a whole day to walk through the entire protected area.
“During the inspection, it is necessary not only to inspect and record biodiversity, but also to inspect the installation of artificial nests, the rescue of injured wild animals, the installation of wild infrared cameras, and so on.”
Songshan National Nature Reserve has now installed more than 200 infrared cameras to record the living conditions of wild animals in the forest.
In the past few years, more and more and more wild animals have appeared in the lens, leopard cats, sturgeon and pig badgers have become "resident guests", and the "appearance rate" of the country's second-class protected animal antelope is also getting higher and higher.
Zhang Zhiming, director of the wildlife and wetland protection department of the Beijing Municipal Bureau of landscaping, said that the number of terrestrial vertebrate vertebrate wild animals in Beijing has increased from 461 in 1994 to more than 500 now, and the variety and number of wild animals in Beijing has continued to increase in recent years.
The presence of wild animals in the city is becoming more and more common, which is closely related to the continuous upgrading of urban greening in the capital in recent years.
In particular, a new round of afforestation and afforestation construction began in 2018, proposing to reshape the urban ecological environment, improve the ecological function of woodland green space, and highlight the concept of "near nature".
The planning strives to achieve interconnection and interaction with the surrounding green areas to make it easy for wild animals to "visit relatives and friends", and the planted trees are also honey sources and food-based plants loved by animals.
Black land "cultivated" agricultural modernization - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Harbin, July 26th: Black land "plants" agricultural modernization
In the middle of the summer, two sprinkler aircraft swept away from the 10,000-acre high-yield demonstration field of the second operating station in the fifth management area of the Friendship Farm, forming two white lines, and a few large characters of "the world's first one" planted with black rice seedlings in the green field were particularly eye-catching.
Kong Lingqiang, the director of the operation station, said that this aircraft can spray more than 6,000 acres of arable land a day, which is about eight times more efficient than that of drones and hundreds of times that of manual labor.
This farm is located in Heilongjiang Province, China's first grain-producing province's friendship county, from the sound of rice cutting in the past to today's "rumbling" motor sound, Chinese traditional farming and farms in this black belt to achieve transformation.
In addition to aircraft, satellites are also used in the modern agricultural production of friendship farms.
On the one hand, they use satellite remote sensing technology to achieve accurate fertilization, reduce agricultural inputs, and reduce pollution; on the other hand, satellite navigation technology can improve the level of standardized operations in agricultural fields.
In this year's rice production process, the farm has expanded the operation area of satellite navigation unmanned cutting technology from last year's 3,000 mu to 30,000 mu.
This technology makes the cultivation of seedlings more uniform, which can maximize the use of sunlight and cultivated land resources, and save 16 yuan in labor costs per acre.
The farm has experimented with new technologies such as informatization and intelligentization in agricultural production, forming the largest agricultural machinery group in China from the ground to the sky.
According to statistics, at present, the total number of farm agricultural machines is 49,000 units (pieces), and the comprehensive mechanization rate in the field has reached 99.8%.
The agricultural machinery operation can achieve 100% GPS satellite navigation, 100% precision sowing of dry fields, and 100% of dryland high-power locomotive operations.
"Green agriculture, smart agriculture, and digital agriculture are the pathfinding directions for agricultural modernization."
Liu Hualian, director of the Friendship Farm, said.
The key to the modernization of agriculture is scientific and technological progress.
In recent years, Heilongjiang agricultural reclamation, represented by farms, has given full play to the demonstration and leading role of modern large-scale agricultural "carriers", and initially established a modern agricultural industrial system dominated by large-scale planting, standardized production, and industrialization operations.
On the outskirts of Friendship Prefecture, there is an agricultural machinery exhibition park covering an area of 350,000 square meters.
It focuses on more than 140 agricultural tools introduced and used in Heilongjiang agricultural reclamation for many years.
These agricultural tools and farms have witnessed the development of China's agricultural modernization.
She small home for everyone-Anhui Hefei Jiangkou River Confluence direct attack-Xinhua.com
Xinhua News Agency, Hefei, July 26th Topic: She Xiaojia for everyone-Anhui Hefei Jiangkou River Confluence direct attack
Xinhua News Agency reporters Chen Shangying, Wang Liwu, Liu Xiacun
At more than four o'clock on the afternoon of July 25th, Fu Kunbao, dressed in mud-covered rubber shoes, went from the front house to the back room, and his wife Zhou Yan was busy picking up things back and forth.
“Received a phone call from the village cadre to transfer, and I’m still in the field.”
Fu Qunbao said that he transferred more than 60 acres of land, planted rice, now the growth is very good, "yesterday also took medicine, the tools have not been packed."
Fu Qunbao pointed to the pesticide sprayer placed in the corner, "No one wants to be flooded at home."
In order to cope with the continuous high water level pressure and the possible heavy rainfall of Chaohu Lake, Hefei City, Anhui Province, is ready to use the Jiangkou River, where Fu Kunbao's family is located, on the 26th.
Chiang estuary is located in Feixi Prefecture, adjacent to Chaohu dyke.
There are thousands of villagers involved in Yandian Township and Sanhe Town that need to be transferred.
As of 16 o'clock on the 25th, China's fifth-largest freshwater lake, the water level is still maintained at a high level of 13.2 meters, exceeding the guaranteed water level of 0.7 meters.
Fu Kunbao family's kitchen is clean, with a basin of pumpkin head vegetables on the table, eggs and some halogens in the refrigerator.
"I didn't expect to move, the water of the Jiangkou River is currently looking good."
Zhou Yan said that the house is a bungalow, and some large objects have not yet figured out where to put it.
â€œThe precious items must be cleaned up first, and the large pieces of the refrigerator and the television can be temporarily placed in the homes of neighbors or relatives who are in the high ground for the first time.”
The village cadre Wang Li steadily gave Fu Kunbao an idea.
Wang is responsible for the transfer and resettlement of 13 villagers, and a household is notified to confirm the resettlement plan of each person.
The closest settlement from Fu Kunbao's family is Yandian Township Su Primary School, about 2 kilometers away.
In addition to the big ones, Fu Kunbao's two headaches also have more than 1,000 pounds of food at home and some of the newly purchased furniture.
“The food is towed to a relative’s house, and the furniture can’t be moved.”
The husband and wife discussed a stool under the newly purchased bed and raised the bed for about half a meter.
At six o'clock in the afternoon, Fu Kunbao began to use tricycles to transport things to his relatives, and Zhou Yan continued to pack at home.
At more than 11 o'clock in the evening, the couple looked at the house before and after, pulled up the electric gate, ready to go to the settlement.
“I wish the water would go away sooner.”
Fu Qunbao said.
At 9:30 a.m. on July 26, the reporter saw at the scene of the Jiangkou River that the local area had been prepared before the flood.
Zhang Ji Colin's small house team to support the muscle boy - Xinhua.com
The sports teen's hot-blooded competition show "Sport Bar Junior" officially landed on Hunan Satellite TV on July 11.
Sports leader Zhang Jiko and sports assistant Lin small house across the same platform, Lin Dan and Fu Yuanhui commented that each has a style, and the "behemoth"-like force pull-up device's hardcore on the field, but also make the program "burning" full force.
In the first episode, 11 sports teenagers appeared on the power track, and at the same time, the "strong conflict", "strong confrontation" and "strong heart" on the stage were also concerned.
Among them, the "strong conflict" comes from the ultra-A sports student Qiao Wenyi, he openly provoked Xu Zhibin, known as the "beautiful man" on the track before the game, and Xu Zhibin's appearance conditions should go to the singing and dancing program, and even let out the "lost don't make-up and cry".
Some of the comments let the teenagers and sports leaders on the field take a cold breath.
The "strong confrontation" is more like a fairy fight, known as the "big demon king" Sun Jianqi met the same strong Zhang Xindong, staged a strong showdown.
And their identity is also unexpected, Sun Jianqi is an actor who loves fitness, Zhang Xindong is a retired special team member, the winner of the Three Warriors Medal.
