In the case of tense competition, as one of the leaders of the "Sport Bar Juniors" movement, Zhang Jico is also seriously watching the battle.
In the review session, he was also very careful, patiently encouraging the teenager who lost the game to help every mistake point in the recovery process.
The sports assistant Lin Xiaojia is a fancy assist, and she makes no secret of her appreciation of the young people online.
It is even more admirable when it comes to understanding the overloaded daily training of sports teenagers.
Lin Dan and Fu Yuanhui, who are also the leader of the sports team, have their own styles, one of which is a "prophecyclerant" who uses a smile to dispel the tense atmosphere.
In addition, Jike and Liu Ye, as sports assistants, have also created a lot of laughing topics around sports teenagers.
Church fire in Nantes, France: Parish volunteers admit to arson
According to foreign media reports, on July 18th, the treasure of religious historical buildings in Nantes, France, and the famous Cathedral of St. Peter and St. Paul were seriously damaged in a fire, and the big organ was completely destroyed.
On the 26th local time, Nantes prosecutors announced that a parish volunteer in charge of guarding the cathedral had been charged with "arson and destruction".
He admitted to igniting himself in the church.
Senas said the 39-year-old diocesan volunteer from Rwanda admitted he had ignited in three places in the cathedral during the night.
The man’s lawyer said the arsonists now regretted doing so.
A few years ago, this person entered France by means of refuge, was sheltered in the diocese where the fire occurred, and was admitted to the church.
The prosecution pointed out that recently, he tried to renew his visa and is in dialogue with the police.
However, the church still can't believe that this usually very kind and smiling believer, who does not talk very much, will destroy the church that he loves so much.
On the day of the fire on July 18, the volunteer had already been questioned by the police because there were illogical problems in the narrative, but he was later released.
Firefighters were rescued at the scene.
On the evening of the 25th, due to new evidence obtained by professional engineers in the laboratory of the central police department in Paris, this person was summoned again.
This time, the man confessed to the act of arson.
According to reports, the suspect could face up to 10 years in prison and a €150,000 fine if convicted of deliberately arson destruction.
According to reports, the fire caused serious damage to the Cathedral of Saint-Pierre and Sao Paulo, the organ inside the church was completely destroyed, and the stained glass window behind the organ was also severely damaged.
According to Brune, the chief architect of the French Historic Pedagogical Building, it is conservatively estimated that the restoration of Nantes Cathedral will take at least three years.
Comprehensive news: U.S. unilateralism destroys bilateral relations, international public opinion supports China's countermeasures against the United States - Xinhua
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- On the morning of July 24, the Chinese Foreign Ministry informed the U.S. Embassy in China that China had decided to rescind its permits for the establishment and operation of the U.S. Consulate General in Chengdu and put forward specific requirements for the Consulate General to cease all operations and activities.
International public opinion believes that the unilateralist measures taken by the United States have caused serious problems in the relations between China and the United States, and it is legitimate and necessary for China to respond to unreasonable provocations by the United States.
Andreas Bolkes, director of the Center for Chinese Studies at the Institute of International Studies of the University of Chile, said that the unilateralist measures of the United States have damaged the bridge of understanding between the two peoples and put the relations between the two great powers into crisis.
China's notification that the U.S. to close its Consulate General in Chengdu is a response to U.S. unilateral measures and is in line with diplomatic practice.
Patricio Justo, a Catholic University professor in Argentina and director of the Argentina-China Research Center, believes that China's above-mentioned decision is a legitimate and necessary counter-measure to the previous provocation of the United States, and is not aimed at the ordinary American people.
The United States is trying to divert the attention of the American people by pressuring China to cover up its weak response to the new crown epidemic.
Bambang Suryono, chairman of the Asian Innovation Research Center, an Indonesian think tank, said that the provocative diplomatic posture taken by the United States has caused serious problems in the relations between China and the United States, and the relations between the two countries are facing serious challenges.
China notifies the U.S. to close its Consulate General in Chengdu as a normal retaliatory measure, in line with diplomatic practice and reflects China's principled position of resolutely safeguarding its own interests, as well as China's rational and beneficial diplomacy.
Tanzanian current affairs commentator Francis Semwinza said that China's above-mentioned decision is a legitimate and necessary response to US provocations.
The US side should take the initiative to improve relations with China and stop interfering in China's internal affairs.
The United States should focus on how to achieve economic and political win-win results with China, and how to benefit the people of the two countries as well as the entire international community.
Ali Yusuf, executive director of the Sudan-based Federation of Arab-China Friendship Associations, said that China's forced countermeasures are a legitimate and necessary response to the unreasonable actions of the United States, in accordance with international law and the basic norms of international relations, as well as in accordance with diplomatic practice.
The U.S. demands the closure of the Chinese Consulate General in Houston seriously violate international law and the basic norms governing international relations.
It is hoped that the United States will rescind the previous relevant decisions and create the necessary conditions for the return of bilateral relations to normal.
Singapore's "Joint Morning Post" published an editorial saying that the greater strategic intention of the United States is to contain China and prevent China from continuing to rise.
In the face of the United States, although China is very reluctant to see that Sino-US relations continue to deteriorate, they have to take counter-measures.
(Participating journalists: Yin Nan, Zhang Smiling, Ni Ruijie, Liang Hui, Gao Bamboo, Li Sibo, Ma Yizhen, Wang Lili)
Xinhua News Agency, Guangzhou, July 26 (Reporter Mao Xin) The reporter learned from the Guangdong Coast Guard Bureau that recently, the Bureau, in conjunction with the Guangzhou customs and public security departments, knocked down a large-scale smuggling of refined refined oil gang to initially verify that the gang has smuggled about 120,000 tons of refined oil since 2019, with a case value of about 800 million yuan and tax evasion of about 240 million yuan.
The Guangdong Coast Guard Bureau and the customs anti-smuggling department have gradually clarified the division of labor and organizational structure of the gang.
On July 8, the coast guard, customs and public security departments carried out a unified network collection operation in Guangzhou, Foshan and other places and the waters of the mouth of the Pearl River, and seized four suspected smuggling ships on the spot, seized a total of 4,700 tons of refined oil in the ships and oil depot, and froze a number of fund accounts.
It is understood that the joint operation dispatched a total of 8 ships and 2 helicopters, which were divided into a number of action teams to work together to carry out a full-chain crackdown on maritime smuggling, illegal land operations and other links, and all 35 major criminal suspects arrived.
The case is currently under further investigation.
The relevant person in charge of the Guangdong Maritime Police Bureau said that in the future, it will continue to maintain a high-pressure situation, crack down on all kinds of illegal and criminal activities of smuggling at sea, and maintain good order in the waters under its jurisdiction.
Cyclone "Hannah" makes landfall in Ueda or causes river surges and flash floods
According to comprehensive foreign media reports, at 5 p.m. local time on the 25th, Hurricane "Hannah" made landfall in the United States of Texas, which will bring strong storms and rains to Texas, and may also cause life-threatening flash floods.
According to the National Hurricane Center, Hurricane Hanna is expected to carry heavy rain, sweeping through parts of the southern and north-eastern parts of the state, which may cause a surge in some streams and life-threatening flash floods.
According to the report, the most affected by Hurricane Hanna is south of the city of Corpus Christi to the estuary of the Rio Grande River, while the Rio Grande Valley is likely to erupt a wide range of flash floods.
Texas Governor Abbot said on the 25th that "any hurricane will be a huge challenge."
Thirty-two counties in the state went into a state of emergency due to the hurricane.
The city of Corpus Christi, with a population of more than 320,000, has closed its libraries and museums, and its residents are waiting.
Abbott also said that at a time when Texas is hit hard by the new crown epidemic, it can no longer allow the hurricane to bring more casualties in Texas.
Precipitation is expected to reach 6 to 12 inches on the night of the 26th, and 3 to 5 inches of rain will also occur in the northern region of Texas and the coastal areas of Louisiana.
Affected by factors such as global warming, "Hannah" formed earlier than the previous Atlantic hurricane season.
In general, the first hurricane in the Atlantic Ocean usually doesn’t develop until the middle of August.
Poland withdraws from European treaty to prevent violence against women
Poland’s justice ministry said on Saturday it would take steps next week to withdraw from a European treaty for the prevention of violence against women.
Poland’s right-wing government cabinet said the treaty required schools to teach students about gender issues, trampling on the rights of their parents.
Poland’s Justice Minister Gioblow told a news conference that his justice ministry on Monday would ask the Ministry of Labor and the Family to begin withdrawing from the treaty.
It is also known as the Istanbul Convention.
“The treaty consists of a number of morphological elements that we consider to be pernicious”.
Poland’s ruling Law and Justice Party and its governing coalition partners have a close alliance with the Roman Catholic Church to promote a conservative social agenda.
Poland’s President Eduard Duda made hostility to gay rights one of the main topics during this month’s successful re-election campaign.
On Friday, tens of thousands of Poles, most of whom were women, held protests in Warsaw and some other cities against withdrawing from the convention.
One of the organisers of the protests, Lem Pat, said at a protest march in Warsaw that "the purpose of withdrawing from the treaty is to legitimize domestic violence".
Some of the protesters carried banners that read “Legislation and Justice is a hell for women.”
The Law and Justice Party has long complained about the Istanbul Convention.
Poland’s previous centrist government ratified the convention in 2015.
The Law and Justice government says the treaty does not respect religion and calls for liberal social policy to be taught in schools.
So far, the party has not decided to withdraw from the convention.
(Reported by Reuters)
Brazil's president's new coronavirus test results turn negative - Xinhua
Brasilia, July 25 (Reporter Zhou Xinzhu) Brazilian President Bolsonaro announced on his personal social media account on the 25th that his latest new coronavirus test results are negative.
In addition to releasing the latest test results, Bolsonaro also posted photos of himself holding hydroxychloroquine boxes on social media.
Bolsonaro has always maintained that this drug can effectively treat the new coronavirus infection, and has repeatedly shown that he took the drug through social media.
According to Brazilian media reports, Bolsonaro on the same day to announce the results of the virus after traveling on a motorbike, went to the capital Brasiliado, and also met with a member of Congress.
Bolsonaro has been segregated at the president’s official residence.
On the 7th of this month, Bolsonaro announced on the 7th of this month in the joint live broadcast of many local media that he personally tested positive for the new coronavirus on the 6th, and two tests were carried out on the 14th and the 21st, and the results were positive.
Jiangxi opened a "green channel" for anti-flood first-line youth enlistment - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Nanchang, July 26 (Guo Dongming, Xiong Liang) Jiangxi Provincial People's Government conscription office has recently made it clear that individuals or their children, who are outstanding in the task of flood relief and disaster relief, meet the conditions for conscription, and the medical examination and political assessment are both qualified.
“Following the registration of the conscripted youth, we will give priority to the soldiers after verification in the community, the armed street department and the recruitment office of the Xunyang District.”
Wang Hui, vice minister of the People's Armed Forces of Xunyang District of Jiujiang City, said that affected by the floods, they began on the 25th and concentrated for three days to organize the medical examination of recruited young people for three days.
Jiujiang Xunyang District enlisted young Zhou Jingfan is a 22-year-old college graduate, his mother is a community worker, his father is a veteran of the Air Force, more than a dozen days Zhou Jingfan's parents have been on duty in the first line of flood control and flood control.
"These days, in the news, I have seen people's children's soldiers defending my hometown on the front line of flood resistance, and I want to be like them."
Zhou Jingfan said that since he was a child, he had a military dream, and through this flood, he strengthened his determination to join the barracks.
Jiujiang City has also taken flood relief as a "living teaching material" for conscription propaganda, and they use the community as a unit, calling on young recruits to voluntarily participate in tasks such as patrol embankment and on-duty, and now they understand the nature and purpose of the people's army and strengthen their confidence to join the army.
Luo Jiuyu, a political commissar of the People's Armed Forces Department of Xunyang District of Jiujiang City, said that by giving priority to troops, he hopes to inspire more young recruits and create a good social atmosphere that participates in the mission and joins the army.
Việt Nam believes that Vietnam has made great contributions to the development of ASEAN over the past 25 years.
Việt Nam is not only a responsible member of ASEAN, but also the locomotive of ASEAN.
Grivori said that Russia and even the Asia-Europe Economic Union believes that Vietnam has made a contribution to enhancing ASEAN's status and promoting its image.
He stressed that “ASEAN should therefore thank Viet Nam”.
Grivori said that analysts recognized Vietnam's peace initiative.
Việt Nam is willing to share its experience with ASEAN countries and put forward constructive and peaceful measures on the issues facing the Asia-Pacific region, including the East Sea issue.
With regard to the cooperation between Vietnam and Russia within the framework of ASEAN, Grivori believes that Vietnam supports the cooperation between Russia and ASEAN and helps Russia gain benefits under this cooperation framework.
After signing a free trade agreement between the Asian-European Economic Union and Vietnam, the Asia-European Economic Union (AEU), including Russia, will be able to enter the ASEAN market.
Grivory proposed to maximize the Asia-Europe Economic Union and the free trade area of ASEAN countries, so as to create a platform of economy and security and stability.
At the same time, Grivori believes that Russia, Vietnam and ASEAN are on the right track and will achieve their goals.
From now until the end of 2020, Beijiang Province will have the necessary conditions, especially in the fields of infrastructure, human resources and land, in order to actively usher in foreign investment inflows, especially multinational groups with value chains and the transfer of advanced technologies.
In addition, Bei Giang Province will submit the Prime Minister's decision to invest in the infrastructure construction and operation projects of the Vietnam-Korea Industrial Zone and approve the addition of two industrial-urban-service areas in Anshan-Beixuan and Anzhao Province's two industrial-urban-service areas to be included in the general plan for the development of Vietnam's industrial zones by 2020.
At the same time, Beijiang Province has focused on accelerating the progress of various projects, especially the infrastructure construction and operation projects of industrial park clusters such as Hefu, Gwangzhu and Shuangxi-Emperor, to form a land fund to attract investment.
In 2020, the Beijiang Provincial Bureau of Industry and Trade will participate in making suggestions and suggestions for the planning of industrial zones and industrial clusters, so as to be included in the provincial plan.
Beijiang Province has decided to combine the development of industrial park clusters with the protection of national defense and security, the protection of the ecological environment and food security, thereby promoting the balanced development of the industry; it has a comprehensive infrastructure such as electricity, water supply, transportation and telecommunications, and is combined with other social infrastructure such as urban construction, trade services, workers' housing and health care, and education.
In the industrial zone, Beijiang Province focuses on high-tech, clean-tech investment projects in the fields of electricity, electronics, telecommunications equipment, precision machinery, auxiliary industries and other fields.
In the cluster of industrial parks, the province calls for small and medium-scale investment projects in the production and utilization of the local labor force, especially in the fields of agricultural products and food processing.
In the future, Beijiang Province will strive to accelerate the investment in the infrastructure of the Beijiang Municipal Logistics and Logistics Center and develop in tandem with industrial park clusters, in order to optimize the circulation of goods and money to help reduce production costs, increase the value of goods, optimize the supply chain, and develop multimodal transport, so as to create attraction for investors to invest in the province.
The upgraded version of the Russian helicopter gunship card-52M at the end of the year for the first time - Xinhua
MOSCOW, July 25 (Xinhua) -- According to the plan of the Russian Ministry of Defense, an upgraded version of the Ka-52 of the Russian helicopter gunship (hereinafter referred to as Wuzhi) Ka-52 will be retrofitted for the first time in December this year, and the model will be greatly improved in terms of reconnaissance, communication and weapon performance.
According to the Russian "News Agency" recently reported that the Wuzhenka-52M is called "super alligator", its development contract was signed by the Russian military and military industrial units in April last year, the first batch of the first batch of the upgraded version is in the Russian "progressive" aerospace company's Far East helicopter manufacturing plant to be modified, its national-level testing and improvement work will be completed by October 2022.
It is understood that the Russian experts in the above-mentioned upgrade work introduced that the "predecessors of the super alligator" - Wu Zhika-52 was officially installed in November 2011, the model exposed some weaknesses in the use, and the transformation and upgrading is to "make up for the shortcomings."
According to reports, compared with the Ka-52, the Ka-52M will partially use a new protective material that does not add weight, and its pilot's cockpit will be reinforced and equipped with new equipment to resist missile attacks, thereby increasing the probability of battlefield survival; equipping more powerful generators to provide power in order to provide power for more complex on-board electronic equipment; the photoelectric system will be upgraded to be able to detect and identify battlefield targets farther away.
In addition, the Ka-52M will have more advanced electronic guidance systems, weapon targeting systems, and navigation equipment.
Russian experts also said that it is worth noting that the Ka-52M will be equipped with communication equipment to communicate with drones, so as to obtain real-time information transmitted by nearby drones in the air, such as displaying images taken by the drone on the cockpit screen of the helicopter.
According to the plan, Ka-52M's pilots can directly control the unmanned aerial vehicles with them, thereby improving the pilot's mastery of the battlefield situation and the guidance of long-range missiles.
According to Russian media reports, Russian Deputy Defense Minister Kryvoruchko said in December last year that the Russian Defense Ministry plans to buy more than 110 Wuzhika-52M by 2027.
According to the new law, Campania must wear masks in indoor public places from now on, and violators can be fined up to 1,000 euros.
On June 1, local time, the Italian capital of Rome and the Colosseum were reopened.
According to reports, according to the latest anti-epidemic law issued by the regional government, the people of Campania must wear masks in accordance with epidemic prevention requirements by all public transport, as well as indoor public places such as shops, bars, supermarkets and pavilions.
Violation of this regulation is punishable by a fine of up to €1,000.
At the same time, the decree stipulates that all passengers from non-Schengen countries entering Campania must be quarantined.
The regional government will authorize health agencies to coordinate the arrangement of specific hotels and the isolation of positive asymptomatic people.
The law came into force on July 25.
In less than an hour’s time, three customers who had entered the supermarket had been fined.
Hebei this year, the ecological replenishment of rivers and lakes 1.75 billion cubic meters
Xinhua News Agency, Shijiazhuang, July 26 (Reporter Wang Kun) The reporter learned from the Hebei Provincial Water Conservancy Department that since this year, Hebei Province has coordinated the use of leading river water and local reservoir water, and successively implemented ecological rehydration to 28 rivers such as Zhandu River, Tang River and Denima River and Baiyangdian, and has completed 1.75 billion cubic meters of ecological replenishment of rivers and lakes.
Hebei Province firmly grasped the favorable opportunity of the south-to-to-north-to-north line project to increase the flow of water, and implemented an ecological hydration of hydration to rivers such as the Tang River, the Shah River and the Lulong River.
At the same time, nine large and medium-sized reservoirs, such as the Western Ocean and Dongwuzhi, as well as the Baiyang Dedian River and the Qinglong River, have implemented ecological hydration, forming a total surface area of more than 90 square kilometers.
In order to do a good job in ecological rehydration work, the Hebei Provincial Water Conservancy Department actively organizes the investigation, rectification and reinforcement and river cleanliness of rivers, refine practical measures, and strengthens supervision and protection.
Through supervision and inspection and centralized unannounced visits, various problems can be solved in a timely manner to ensure the safe and orderly replenishment of the river.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Hebei Provincial Water Conservancy Department, the orderly implementation of the ecological hydration of rivers and lakes has effectively repaired the ecological environment of rivers and lakes in Hebei Province, promoted the recuperation and conservation of coastal groundwater, greatly improved the living environment and economic development environment along the route, which is of great significance to the goal of "water clear, bank-green, river smooth and beautiful".
In the past two weeks, the number of newly confirmed crown cases in Spain has rebounded sharply, and there have been thousands of new cases in the past few days.
On the evening of Saturday (July 25), the British government temporarily decided to remove Spain from the safe travel list from 0:00 local time on the 26th, and people entering the United Kingdom from Spain must be quarantined for 14 days.
British tourists who are vacationing in Spain are surprised, worried, and even angry that the news is unexpected.
British Transport Minister Grant Shapps is also currently on holiday in Spain.
Before the United Kingdom issued the quarantine measures, Norway has also announced a 10-day quarantine for those returning to Norway from Spain.
“France and Belgium have advised their residents to abandon their plans for a holiday in front of Barcelona as well as the surrounding area.
The beaches in these areas were overcrowded and unable to maintain social distancing between people, and the police at one point needed to take steps to reduce the number of beach visitors.
The tourism industry is an important pillar industry in Spain.
Spain: It's safe here.
In response to the British decision, Spain's foreign ministry said on Sunday that the country's outbreak was under control.
Spanish Foreign Minister Arancha Gonzalez Laya said: “Spain is safe, not only for Spaniards but also for tourists.”
The Spanish government will try to persuade the British government to exclude the Balearic and Canary Islands from quarantine measures.
The reason is that the infection rate of these two tourist resorts is much lower than that of the United Kingdom.
In order to prevent the spread of the epidemic, Spain's Catalonia region has also restarted the "foot ban".
The tourism industry is an important pillar industry in Spain, and Spain is one of the most popular holiday destinations for British tourists.
Britain’s decision is expected to affect Spain’s tourism industry.
Quiet / Ren Chen (German News Agency, Reuters)
On the first day of the first day, Beijing took a break from the high-temperature and sweltering heat to turn on the rainfall mode-Xinhua.com
BEIJING, July 26 (Reporter Ni Yuanjin) July 26th is the first day of this year's "centre".
In the early morning of the 26th, the strong wind and rain convulsive weather dissipated the high-temperature and sweltering heat that shrouded the Beijing area for several days, and a new round of rain weather will continue for several days.
The Beijing Municipal Meteorological Observatory released at 11 o'clock on the 26th that there were scattered showers in Beijing on the 26th (accompanied by weak lightning), and the daily maximum temperature was only 27 °C; there were small to medium rain at night (accompanied by weak lightning), and the minimum temperature at night was 23 °C.
From the 24th to the 25th, the whole city of Beijing was in a high-temperature blue warning, and the daily maximum temperature in most areas was about 37 °C, and there was a high temperature of more than 40 °C in the local area.
Futian is the warmest, humid and sweltering day of the year, there are "three volts" in the year, the warmest volts, the Chinese people say "bitter summer" is at this time.
At the entrance, the family fills the barn, and the people have a saying of "one-volt dumpling two-volt face".
According to the current forecast, in the next three days, the rainy weather in Beijing.
The meteorological department reminded the public to minimize playing in the mountains and beware of geological disasters.
It is understood that this year's "middle" has 20 days, starting from July 26th and ending on August 14th.
After entering the "middle volts", people will feel weak in the body and loss of appetite.
You can choose foods such as green beans and squirrel that have the effect of pyrolysis, spleen appetizers, as well as bitter vegetables, bitter melons and other bitter foods, which can help to increase appetite and remove the heat.
The FAA urgently ordered the inspection of 2,000 Boeing passenger aircraft
The U.S. Federal Aviation Administration (FAA) issued an emergency airworthiness directive on the 24th, requiring an emergency inspection of about 2,000 Boeing 737NG and 737 Classic passenger aircraft registered in the United States, due to corruptibility of the aircraft's air non-return valve, which may cause the engine to stop in the air after it is corrupted.
The FAA said it has so far received four air-to-navigation reports of 737NG and 737 Classic airliner engines, resulting in an emergency inspection of airliners parked for more than seven days in a row and those that have flown less than Eleven so far after being re-entered.
The Federal Aviation Administration has warned that a Level 5 non-return valve for all two of the airliner's engines could be stuck in an open position, causing the aircraft to completely lose power and be unable to restart the engine.
The aviation regulator ordered that once the check valve is found to be corroded, air operators must replace this key component before the passenger plane is put into service again.
Boeing responded later in the same day, the outbreak of the new crown epidemic has led to a decrease in the demand for travel, and many passenger aircraft have been sealed or less used, and "the check valve is more likely to be corroded."
At the same time, Boeing said that it has recommended that air operators inspect the passenger aircraft involved in the instructions, and if the problem is found, Boeing will provide assistance such as maintenance and replacement of check valves.
According to the Associated Press, passenger aircraft owned by major U.S. airlines usually fly several times a day, but after the outbreak of the new crown epidemic, a large number of passenger aircraft were grounded; with the recent slow growth in passenger travel demand, some airliners were put back into operation.
The FAA didn’t release the details of the four aerial parking reports.
Alaska Airlines later disclosed one of the incidents.
The carrier said in a statement that one of its airliners was flying from Seattle, Washington, on July 15 to Austin, Texas, when an engine suddenly turned off, and the passenger plane finally made an emergency landing at Austin Airport.
Alaska Airlines said it had replaced the engines of the passenger plane and had inspected the engines of the six in accordance with FAA instructions.
American Airlines, United Airlines and Southwest Airlines separately said on the 24th that their passenger aircraft did not have an engine shutdown associated with an air check valve.
The four American Airlines passenger aircraft will be inspected, and United’s 28 aircraft will be inspected.
Delta Air Lines said it would inspect its 20 passenger jets, but did not say whether there had been an engine shutdown.
According to multiple media reports, the Federal Aviation Administration's emergency airworthiness directive is another shock to Boeing.
Indonesia's Lion Air and the Ethiopian Airlines Boeing 737 MAX crashed in October 2018 and March 2019, respectively, killing a total of 346 people.
This series of passenger aircraft was subsequently grounded around the world, stopped production in January this year, and resumed production in May this year.
FAA Administrator Steve Dickson admitted in June that the FAA made a “wrong mistake” with regard to Boeing’s regulation of the 737 MAX airliner.
"Ding on the line! good teacher" next week on-line Xue Zhaofeng led the "knowledge initiator-Xinhua network
There’s a new show on the line.
The interactive knowledge-sharing program "Ding Ding Goes On-line!" will be broadcast on Hunan Satellite TV from July 20.
It is understood that the program will create a new all-age youth classroom, and a group of gifted and talented teachers will fight to challenge the export of interesting knowledge.
Different from the serious impression of the teacher group in the hearts of the public in the past, "Ding Ding on the Line!Teacher" is a group of intellectual representatives with both face value and talent.
They are both role models for the knowledge of young people from various disciplines, but also a group of omnipotent "sucators" who will shake the burden and are good at edutainment.
In the program, this group of outstanding young people's intellectual role models as "knowledge-sharing officers" will challenge interesting knowledge classes.
They need to impress the spectators by having an attitudinal knowledge to show the funniest aspects of their discipline.
All-year-old spectators will put forward a variety of questions on the spot, which will increase the difficulty of "knowledge-sharing officers", and also add a somewhat exciting atmosphere to the program.
It is revealed that the "knowledge-sharing officers" include Li Yongle, a physics teacher at the secondary school affiliated to Renmin University, Zhang Xuefeng, a research instructor, and outstanding young teachers such as Wang Lei, a history teacher with ten years of professional experience, who will show the "hard core" knowledge of various disciplines to the audience in an unexpected way.
In addition, the program also invited Xue Zhaofeng, professor of economics, as the program's "innovator of knowledge", combined with Du Haitao and Jing Mengjia, to discuss youth with the audience and create a "universal youth open class".
The Secretary for Administration of the Government of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region: the situation is severe and the situation is full of efforts to fight the epidemic - Sino-Singapore Network
HONG KONG, July 26 (Xinhua) -- Zhang Jianzong, Chief Secretary for Administration of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government, said on the 26th that the new crown pneumonia epidemic situation in Hong Kong will continue to be severe, and if the epidemic worsens, the SAR government will decisively take more stringent control measures to further restrict the operation of business premises and reduce the number of citizens going out.
However, at this stage, the SAR government has no intention to introduce a "home order" or a "vacation order" to restrict the public from going out.
On the same day, Zhang Jianzong published a website entitled "Severe situation and full anti-epidemic".
He said that the epidemic is the most severe in the past six months, the next two weeks will be very critical to try to prevent the further spread of the virus in the community.
In addition to the necessary measures taken by the SAR government, it is also very important for citizens to exercise self-discipline and cooperation.
He called on the public to try to stay at home, reduce social contact and go out to eat.
The members of the public should cooperate with the mandatory measures of wearing masks to protect themselves and others, pay attention to personal and environmental hygiene and frequent hand-washing, and suspend non-necessary gatherings of relatives and friends or meals and reduce them to the streets.
He said that the central government has always been very concerned about the changes in the epidemic situation in Hong Kong and supporting the SAR government's anti-epidemic and anti-epidemic work, and has actively responded to the latest request of the Chief Executive to provide assistance in increasing detection capabilities and renovating the work of the Asia-Pacific International Exposition Center for similar "square cabin hospitals".
Zhang Jianzong said that the free virus testing provided by the SAR government for specific high-risk groups, namely nursing homes, disability and nursing home employees, restaurant employees, taxi drivers and property management employees, has been fully implemented, involving as many as 400,000 people.
He is very concerned about the number of infections that have appeared in nursing homes, and the SAR government has arranged a specific temporary quarantine center for nursing home residents.
He said that the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region government is building a quarantine and quarantine facility near the Bamboo Bay quarantine center on Lantau Island in the New Territories, and it is expected to provide an additional 700 isolation rooms by the end of September.
The chief executive also announced on the 19th that the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region government will build an additional 2,000 isolation rooms in the Bamboo Bay Quarantine Center and aim to complete it by the end of this year.
Coupled with the 800 units that have already been put into use in the quarantine center, it is expected to provide a total of 3,500 isolation rooms by the end of the year.
Hong Kong currently has a total of about 2,600 quarantipantal units in operation, providing a total of about 2,600 isolation rooms.
In addition, on the 24th, the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government reactivated the Carp Gate Park Resort on Hong Kong Island as a community isolation facility to treat patients under the age of 50 with independent self-care ability.
