Adhere to the advanced deeds of the older generation of revolutionaries as a reference and guidance, continue to polish the political nature of the Communists, to maintain only the morning and evening, to strive for a long-sought attitude and the more difficult the more forward the spirit of the struggle, in the great rejuvenation of the Chinese nation, to write their own brilliant.
"Shang Jiangnan" in pursuit of the poetic "Yellow River dream"
(China's story of poverty reduction) "Shang Jiangnan" in pursuit of the poetic "Yellow River dream"
Yinchuan, China News Agency, July 26 (Yang Di) "Nine songs of the Yellow River, the waves of the wind from the ends of the earth."
The Yellow River, which has aroused the pride of countless artisans, gave birth to a beautiful and rich Ningxia plain, and now Ningxia, which has the name of "Shang Jiangnan", is adhering to the concept of "ecological priority and green development" and pursuing a poetic "Yellow River dream".
The "Bibo Dream" of the river clear water show.
"Yellow River Fu Ningxia", the Yellow River through Ningxia 397 kilometers, is the "mother river".
However, with the rapid promotion of industrialization and urbanization, the development and utilization of rivers and lakes are unbalanced in the protection and protection of rivers and lakes, over-the-standard sewage discharges, the formation of fields around the lake, and the encroachment of the waters are highlighted, resulting in black and odorous water, excessive water quality, dirty environment, and ecological degradation.
At present, Ningxia is promoting the restoration of water ecological diversity, and strives to return to the Yellow River.
The water needs to be done from the source.
In Yinchuan, Ningxia Yinchuan, the local government adopts the method of "proportion + decontamination + strict control", the centralized treatment of sewage in the industrial park has all been centrally treated, the urban sewage treatment plants have all achieved Class A standard discharge, and the black and odorous water bodies in the urban built-up areas have been basically eliminated, and the third batch of China's black and odorous water demonstration cities has been successfully declared.
In addition, Ningxia fully implemented the long-term system of rivers and lakes in 2017, and has now achieved full coverage of the five-level river and lake long-term responsibility system in districts, cities and counties, and the long-distance river patrol has become the norm.
The 64-year-old Gu Jincheng, who lives in a village on the Yellow River, has witnessed changes in the Yellow River: “There was a stink in the water in the past, and the stink after remediation is gone.”
Gu Jincheng said that the ecological environment is good, his life is also more comfortable, and now he often goes to the Yellow River with his family to take a walk and feel the blue sky.
"Wetland dreams" of sand gulls
Flying birds, green trees, trestle roads, turquoise water... the beautiful scenery of "sand gulls gatherings" in Ningxia Yinchuan Yellow River Wetland Park has become a reality.
Through Ningxia, the Yellow River has formed a variety of wetlands such as river wetlands, lake wetlands and marsh wetlands along the way, which plays an important role in promoting the rational utilization of water resources and water ecological balance, and has also become an important international bird migration channel.
Since 2009, the relevant departments of Ningxia have invested about 3.45 billion yuan in wetland protection projects. At present, Yinchuan Wetlands covers an area of 19,200 hectares, with a wetland protection rate of 78.5%, with nearly 200 natural lakes and marsh wetlands, with 5 national wetland parks, 1 national urban wetland park, 6 autonomous region-level wetland parks, and 8 municipal-level parks.
Lu Jinhu, deputy director of Yinchuan Wetland Conservation Center, told reporters that wetland protection has increased biodiversity, which is particularly evident in birds: "The gull is an endangered bird, there are only more than 20,000 in the world, of which Yinchuan Wetland has more than 2,000."
At the same time, in accordance with the law, Ningxia has delineated a red line within a 500-meter range for the wetland protection area on both sides of the Yinchuan section of the Yellow River, stipulating that in addition to public welfare projects, no unit or individual shall carry out development, construction and business activities within the scope of protection.
Yinchuan Municipal Water Conservancy Service Center Deputy Director Zhao Shaoyong introduced, through pollution source control, comprehensive remediation of the ecology of the rivers and lakes and the construction of the end of the wetland, Ningxia's 9 main into the yellow gutter water quality has been 100% reached the Class IV standard, "now the water is also clear, the fish is also swimming, the flowers are also opened."
People's "drinking water dream"
Ningxia Yinchuan City once had an "embarrassing" title: it was the only city that "guarded the Yellow River to lack of water and drink".
Since 2010, Yinchuan City has begun to face the problem of continuous water shortage at the peak of the summer, and the "pain of water shortage" in the past ten years has become the painful summer experience of many high-floor residents, but in the major water sources are over-harvesting, and the urban underground has formed a large-scale groundwater over-harvesting funnel area.
Benefiting from the improvement of the water quality of the Yellow River, the purified yellow river water has become a good way to solve the problem of drinking water for local residents.
Ding Ming, deputy director of Yinchuan Municipal Bureau of Water, said that in order to improve the production and water needs of urban and rural residents in Yinchuan, Ningxia promptly launched the Yinchuan metropolitan urban and rural western water supply project to replace the original groundwater source with high-quality Yellow River water.
On December 29, 2019, the water supply project was officially connected to Yinchuan City, and in 2020, the residents of Minning Township and Helan County also drank the water of the Yellow River."
Ding Ming said that Yinchuan water conservancy department will comprehensively take into account the transformation of the integration of regional rural drinking water and urban water supply, "the next step, we will integrate the rural scattered water supply points into the western water supply project, it is expected that by the end of this year, urban and rural integrated water supply in Yinchuan region will be basically realized."
Various departments to strengthen flood prevention and disaster relief work-Zhongxin
Prudging responsibilities Various departments to strengthen flood prevention and disaster relief work
