For the first time, the United States launched a counter-subsidy investigation against China with "undervaluation of the RMB exchange rate".
According to the recent announcement of the US Department of Commerce, it has decided to launch an anti-dumping and anti-subsidy investigation on belt (beam belt) products originating in China, and launched an investigation on the "RMB exchange rate undervaluation" project.
China's Ministry of Commerce pointed out that this is the first time for the United States to investigate the so-called "RMB exchange rate undervaluation" project in the countervailing case, and China firmly opposes it.
On the evening of the 23rd, China's Ministry of Commerce specifically issued a press release on the evening of the 23rd, saying that China implements a floating exchange rate system based on market supply and demand, with reference to a basket of currencies to adjust, and the market plays a decisive role in the formation of the exchange rate.
The press release stressed that in general, the RMB exchange rate is at a reasonable equilibrium level and is not underestimated.
Since 2005, the RMB has appreciated by more than 17% against the U.S. dollar.
According to the data released by the Bank for International Settlements, from the beginning of 2005 to May 2020, the effective exchange rate appreciated by 38%, and the real effective exchange rate appreciated by 49%, making it the most powerful currency in the G20 economy and one of the most appreciating currencies in the world.
The Ministry of Commerce pointed out that the exchange rate issue exceeds the competence of members to carry out countervailing investigations in accordance with World Trade Organization rules.
In February of this year, the United States amended its regulations to carry out countervailing investigations on the exchange rates of other countries, which has been suspected of violating the rules of the World Trade Organization (WTO).
Even in accordance with U.S. laws and regulations, there are a large number of errors in the content of the applicant's complaint and do not have the necessary elements of countervailing duties such as financial support, interest-granting, and exciliation.
The Chinese side urges the United States to abide by the existing international rules and stop carrying out countervailing investigations on the so-called "undervaluation of the RMB exchange rate".
Affected by rising tensions between China and the United States, the exchange rate of the offshore and on-shore yuan against the U.S. dollar fell sharply on the 22nd day, and both fell below the 7.0 yuan mark of the US dollar against the yuan.
Whether the U.S. Department of Commerce's move is intended to force a rise in the yuan is worthy of
The current exchange rate against the U.S. dollar rose above the 7.0 mark on the 23rd, closing at 6.9961.
The median exchange rate of the RMB against the U.S. dollar, which is subject to official regulation, was lowered by 17 basic points on the 24th to 6.9938.
With the gradual improvement of the epidemic, the film and television industry, which has been silent for nearly half a year, has also returned to normal.
A few days ago, the organizing committee of the 26th Shanghai TV Festival announced the shortlist of this year's Magnolia Award.
In terms of the best male and female actors, the dominant actor in the strength group occupies an absolute advantage, Lei Jiayin, Chen Baoguo, Zhang Ruoyin, Sun Honglei, Huang Lei will compete for the best actor, Haiqing, Ma Yiling, Qin Hailu, Sun Jun, Yan Ni will compete for the best actress.
The results will be officially announced on August 7.
From the current point of view, starting from the college entrance examination topic, depicting the "Chinese-style family's" reality education-themed TV series "Little Joy" and won a total of 6 nominations for "best Chinese TV series", "best director", "best screenwriter", "best actress" and "best male/female supporting roles".
The "best male and female protagonist" award has always been one of the concerns of the outside world, this year's competition is also particularly fierce, the shortlisted male and female actors are the strength of the good drama people, Chen Baoguo, Huang Lei, Lei Jiayin, Sun Honglei, Zhang Ruoyan will be the "best actor" competition.
Chen Baoguo, Huang Lei and Sun Honglei are highly qualified middle-aged actors, 37-year-old Lei Jiayin is also a powerful actor, as for 32-year-old Zhang Ruoyan is the youngest finalist.
In 2016, the 34-year-on-year-old Hu Ge won the White Magnolia Award for Best Actor, becoming the youngest emperor in the award, and this year, if Zhang will be able to overcome several other predecessors, he will set a new record.
The competition for the best actress is also finally anchored in Haiqing, Mahixuan, Qin Hailu, Sun Jun, and Yan Ni in the film and television industry.
It is worth mentioning that Sun Jun was shortlisted with the "Settling House" room, which is the sixth time that she has been nominated for this award, and in 2014 and 2016, she won the "best actress" twice with "Spicy Mother's Tale" and "Yueconomy".
On the morning of the 26th, the Fujian Provincial Health and Health Commission reported the latest outbreak of new crown pneumonia, saying that from 0 to 24:00 on July 25, Fujian Province reported a new case of imported asymptomatic infection outside the province, 1 new confirmed case imported from abroad, and 4 cases of imported asymptomatic infection from abroad.
Among them, the new asymptomatic infection outside the province is imported from Dalian, Liaoning Province (Fuzhou city report), and the newly imported confirmed cases from abroad are imported into the Philippines (Xiamen city report); 4 new imported asymptomatic infected persons from abroad, of which: 1 case imported from the United States (Fuzhou city report) and 3 cases imported from the Philippines (Xiamen city report).
As of 24:00 on July 25, Fujian Province reported a total of 69 imported confirmed cases from abroad, 66 cases have been cured and discharged from the hospital, and there are currently 3 hospitalizations with no deaths; there are 0 suspected suspected cases imported from abroad; 13 cases of imported asymptomatic infected persons are still receiving centralized isolated medical observation; 296 locally confirmed cases have been reported (295 cases have been discharged from the hospital, 0 current hospitalizations and 1 death); 0 local suspected cases have been reported.
At present, 14,962 close contacts have been relieved of medical observation, and 324 people are still undergoing medical observation.
The cumulative number of confirmed cases in Brazil is close to 2.4 million, the city of Rio announced the cancellation of New Year's celebrations
According to the data, as of now, the cumulative number of confirmed cases and deaths in Brazil ranks second in the world, after the United States.
The state of São Paulo, the worst affected state, has nearly 480,000 confirmed cases and more than 20,000 deaths.
More than 160,000 cases and 150,000 cases were confirmed in the states of Ceará and Rio de Janeiro, respectively, and more than 140,000 in the states of Pará and Bahia.
More than 110,000 cases have also been confirmed in the states of Maranhão and Minasjinas.
On the 25th, the mayor of Rio de Janeiro, Marcelo Crivela, announced on the 25th that in view of the continuous spread of the new crown pneumonia epidemic in Brazil, the effective vaccine has not yet been marketed, the city has decided to cancel the New Year's celebrations in 2021.
In the past, the city held celebrations on the famous Copacabana beach on the day of the New Year, attracting 2.9 million people on the last day of the year in 2019.
At the same time, the city also decided to postpone the 2021 carnival event from February next year to September.
Sao Paulo Mayor Bruno Covas has announced on the 24th that it will cancel the city's New Year's celebrations originally scheduled to be held on Paulista Street on December 31 this year, and postponed the 2021 carnival until the end of May or the beginning of July next year.
Venezuelan foreign minister accuses the United States of fabricating lies against China's unprovocative attack - Xinhua
Arreisa said the U.S. government's recent political, diplomatic, economic and public-opintenological pressure on China is an unwarranted attack on a sovereign country.
Arreza retweeted a tweet posted by China’s ambassador to Venezuela, Li Baorong, on his personal account earlier in the day.
Li Baorong said in a tweet that China strongly condemns the forced entry of the United States into the Chinese Consulate General in Houston, which is a serious violation of the Vienna Convention on Consular Relations and the Sino-US Consular Treaty.
Venezuelan Vice President Rodrigues, Deputy Foreign Minister for North American Affairs Carlos Long and other government officials, luminaries in society and mainstream media reporters have also retweeted Li Baorong's tweets, accusing the United States of serious violations of international law.
On the 26th, the day before Philippine President Duterte's fifth State of the Union (SONA), the cumulative number of confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia in the Philippines had more than 80,000, of which the number of confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia (PCOO) and the staff of its affiliated institutions increased to 25.
To this end, the PCOO has specially prepared a working group that has no contact with confirmed employees to cooperate with President Duterte's press release of SONA.
PCOO Minister Martin Andanar said in an interview with the DZBB radio station on the 26th that two sets of plans have been prepared for President Rodrigo Duterte to publish the SONA method.
According to the A plan, on the afternoon of the 27th, Duterte will publish SONA in the Batasang Pambansa building of the Philippine Congress in Quezon City on the afternoon of the 27th.
Because of the epidemic, only 50 seats were arranged for some government cabinet members and legislators at the scene, and a special video conference room was set up for other cabinet members and local government officials to watch.
On the same day, all participants can enter the parliament building through rapid testing.
As soon as one of the participants tested positive, plan B was launched, that is, President Rodrigo Duterte issued a SONA at the Malacian Palace in the presidential palace, and fewer listening seats were arranged at the scene.
In accordance with the usual practice, SONA will be broadcast to the Philippines in real-time.
As of press time, the Philippine presidential palace has not yet confirmed whether Duterte's family will attend SONA.
Andanar said that President Rodrigo Duterte's SOLA will focus on how the government will lead the Philippines to deal with the new crown pneumonia epidemic and restore socio-economic life, and will also refer to his commitments when he took office to combat anti-government corruption, cracking down on illegal drugs and reducing poverty.
Duterte will also elaborate on the administration’s other plans, including creating more jobs, revitalizing the economy, promoting education, and helping overseas Filipino workers who are suffering from the outbreak.
Yinchuan: classification policy to support kindergarten stable teacher team - Xinhua
Yinchuan, Xinhua News Agency, July 26 (Reporter Ai Fumei) Affected by the impact of the epidemic, Ningxia Yinchuan Kindergarten has not yet been reopened, especially the financial pressure of private kindergartens has increased, which will have a certain impact on the stability and sustainable development of kindergarten teachers in the future.
In this regard, Yinchuan City has taken a number of measures such as subsidizing subsidy funds for inclusive private kindergartens, stabilizing subsidies for non-inclusive private kindergartens, and reducing the rent of private kindergartens to support the stable teaching staff of these kindergartens.
According to the relevant policies of Yinchuan City, during the period of the epidemic, inclusive private kindergartens (including kindergartens that have been converted into inclusive kindergartens in urban communities after the management of inclusive kindergartens) are organized according to the minimum wage standards of the three districts, and the basic living expenses of not less than 1660 yuan per person per month shall be issued to the basic living allowance of not less than 1660 yuan per person per month, the municipal finance will be in accordance with the standard of 1,000 yuan per student per year for inclusive private kindergarten students.
For non-inclusive private kindergartens that are not less than 1,660 yuan of basic living expenses are also distributed to teaching and staff each month, Yinchuan City will arrange 6-month subsidy funds as stable subsidy funds for early childhood teachers in accordance with the average subsidy standard of 500 yuan per student per year.
At the same time, Yinchuan City will reduce the rent of housing for three months during the prevention and control of the epidemic, and encourage developers to assume social responsibilities, reduce the rent of kindergarten rents for more than 3 months, and encourage developers to assume social responsibilities, reduce the rent of kindergartens for more than 3 months, in accordance with the provisions of the relevant taxes.
Yangtze Yangtze River No. 3 Flood Formation Water Conservancy Ministry refines practical response measures-Zhongxin.com
BEIJING, July 26 (Xinhua) -- On July 26, the Yangtze River's No. 3 flood formed in 2020.
The minister of water conservatories requested on the sidelines of the meeting on the 26th to fine-tune the Three Gorges Reservoir, take into account the upper reaches of the Yangtze River and Dongting Lake, carry out the wrong peak scheduling, reserve capacity to prepare for major floods and possible major floods, and to ensure the flood safety of the middle and downstream dry currents and the important embankments of Dongting Lake.
According to the forecast, in the next three days, there will be heavy rain in the eastern part of the southwest, the southern part of Jianghuai, the western part of Jiangnan and the eastern part of Hubei and the central part of Guangxi, of which there will be heavy rain in northern Hunan and south-western Jiangsu; there will be medium to heavy rain in central and western central China, of which there will be heavy rain in central Hebei.
The Ministry of Water Resources expects that due to its impact, the flow rate of the Three Gorges Reservoir upstream of the Yangtze River may reach about 60,000 cubic meters per second on the 28th, and the water level of the midstream dry-flow Lianhuatang River and Dongting Lake will rise again and exceed the protection of about 0.20 meters.
Even Ping put forward that the Huai river basin should further increase the intensity of flood excretion, reduce the water level of Hongze Lake as soon as possible, and be prepared to face major floods that may occur.
It is necessary to do a good job to deal with heavy rains and floods.
He pointed out that the Taihu River Basin should unrelentingly continue to increase the intensity of flood drainage, reduce the water level of Taihu Lake and the surrounding river network as soon as possible, and reduce the risk of Taihu Lake's high water level and Typhoon.
In addition, he stressed that the floods in northern regions such as Inner Mongolia and Hebei have risen and fallen, and the early warning time is short, which is very easy to cause flash floods and mudslides, and it is difficult to control; the number of small and medium-sized reservoirs and silting dams is large, and there are safety hazards.
Fifty-eight apps that violated the rights and interests of users have been exposed, involving more than a dozen listed companies
In accordance with laws and regulations such as the Cyber Security Law, the Telecommunications Regulations and the Regulations on the Protection of the Personal Information of Telecommunications and Internet Users, third-party testing institutions have recently been organized to inspect mobile phone applications and urge enterprises with problems to make rectification.
There are problems with these 58 APPs, such as collecting personal information privately, collecting personal information beyond the scope, frequently applying for permissions, excessive requests for permissions, account cancellation difficulties, private sharing to third parties, and not giving permission.
According to the requirements of the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology, 58 APPs should complete the rectification and implementation work by July 30, and if the rectification is overdue, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology will carry out the relevant disposal work in accordance with the law.
The Sino-Singapore reporter combed and found that behind the reported 58 APPs, involving more than a dozen US stocks, Hong Kong stocks and A-share listed companies.
For example, there are a lot of "rooms" for U.S.-based listed companies, there are five major issues: private collection of personal information, excessive collection of personal information, private sharing to third parties, forcing users to use the targeted push function, and frequently applying permissions.
According to the public information, more houses landed on Nasdaq in November 2019, and is the "first real estate intermediary company in the industrial Internet SaaS (software service) model in China" to provide online solutions for many intermediary merchants.
In response to the difficulty of canceling the APP account pointed out in the notice, according to the Beijing News, where the network responded that in order to prevent black production from using frequent registration and cancellation to obtain benefits, where to register on the basis of self-registration and write-off needs to be set for a one-month interval.
At present, the ease of cancellation and account security have been comprehensively considered, which has been changed to take effect immediately, and it is currently awaiting review.
A network security expert, who did not want to be named, said that the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology has issued it three times this year that it infringes on the rights and interests of users.
Among them, private collection of personal information, excessive requests for permissions, account cancellation is difficult three problems repeatedly "managing".
It can also be seen from the report that APP invasion of privacy has attracted more and more attention.
On July 24, on the same day that 58 APPs that violated the rights and interests of users, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology said that it had recently issued a notice to carry out special rectification actions to promote APP infringement of users' rights and interests in depth.
The special remediation will strengthen supervision and inspection in accordance with the regulations, urge relevant enterprises to strengthen the protection of APP personal information, timely rectification to eliminate outstanding problems such as illegal collection, the use of users' personal information and harassment of users, defrauding and misleading users, application distribution platform management responsibilities are not in place, and purify the APP application space.
The Lewis family: John Lewis was a fighter who "fights for the weakest".
U.S. Congressman John Lewis, a civil rights fighter, was remembered as a “fight for the weakest” at his memorial service on Saturday (July 25).
Lewis' public memorial service has been held in Alabama since Saturday.
On the first day, there were two memorial services.
At a memorial service at Troy University in Alabama on Saturday, Lewis’s five siblings and a great-grandson described him as a loving, timid, family-heavy man.
His youngest brother, Henry “Grant” Lewis, said at the meeting: “He’s dedicated his life to helping others.”
Samuel Lewis said that his mother had warned John "not to get into trouble, not to get into trouble."
He added that John didn’t heed his mother’s warning, saying, “We all know that John is always going to get into trouble and always getting into trouble, but it’s because he’s doing what’s the right thing, it’s a good trouble.”
Lewis’s sibling reminded people at the memorial service that John’s best-known argument was to create “good trouble,” that is, as long as it was for the sake of justice.
John applied to Troy University in Troy, Alabama, where he was born, but the all-and-for-a-white-only University of Troy rejected his application for admission.
John Lewis, who preached evangelizing chickens on his farm as a child, eventually earned a degree in religion and philosophy from Fisk University.
A few years later, the University of Troy awarded Lewis an honorary doctorate.
U.S. Senator Doug Jones, from Alabama, said the current protesters were “provocing peacefully, non-violently,” just as Lewis did in the civil rights movement.
Jones said: “Even if President Donald Trump overturned a boatman with a pole and told all the protesters as rioters, he was wrong.
Protesters are patriots who want the United States to move towards a more egalitarian nation.”
A six-day series of events to commemorate Lewis will climax this week at a funeral in Georgia.
Lewis' coffin was parked at a public memorial service at the University of Troy on Saturday, and people came to pay homage to the civil rights activist.
Later on Saturday, a private ceremony saluted him at a small church in Selma, Alabama, followed by a public memorial service.
On Sunday, Lewis’s body will pass through the Edmund Pettus Bridge in Selma.
In 1965, he and the demonstrators who demanded the right to vote of black people were severely beaten in front of the bridge by the Alabama police, who also threw tear gas at the demonstrators.
Lewis was nearly killed at the time.
It is now known as “Bloody Sunday”.
Lewis’ body will be transported to Montgomery, Alabama’s capital.
Mayor Steven Reed encouraged people to line up on the pavement to complete this final journey with Lewis.
At the same time, officials asked the public to wear masks and maintain social distance when participating in the event.
Alabama Governor Kay Ivey ordered the flag to be flown at half-mast on Saturday and Sunday in honor of Lewis.
For nearly a week of remembrance, Lewis's body will be divided between the Alabama State Capitol in Montgomery, the Georgia State Capitol in Atlanta, and the U.S. Capitol in Washington, D.C.
U.S. House of Representatives Speaker Nancy Pelosi and Senate Majority Leader Mitch McConnell announced last week that people could go to the U.S. Capitol this Monday and Tuesday to pay their homage.
Due to the coronavirus epidemic, the public event to commemorate Lewis will be held outdoors.
Shenzhen has publicly solicited opinions on the introduction of health regulations - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Shenzhen, July 26 (Reporter Mao Siquan, Bai Yu) encourages residents to do medical examinations and find problems early; prohibit the sale of alcoholic beverages to minors; establish an online game health review system; employers should be equipped with full-time and part-time health management personnel...
In order to encourage residents to do medical examinations and detect problems early, the above-mentioned consultation draft proposes that the health department should formulate a basic catalogue of health examination projects according to different ages, occupations and other factors.
The cost of the health examination within the scope of the basic catalogue of the health examination project shall be paid by the social medical insurance co-ordinating fund in accordance with the annual standard of each person.
The draft for comment makes it clear that the employing unit should rationally allocate human resources, arrange the staff's working time, and implement the rest system for employees with heavy mental and physical labor loads, so as to avoid excessive loss of human function or damage to physical and mental health caused to the health of employees, and strictly implement the paid leave system for employees.
In addition, the employing unit should be equipped with full-time and part-time health management personnel, and regularly carry out employee health check-ups.
In terms of the physical and mental health of minors, it is proposed that the sale of alcoholic beverages to minors should be prohibited, and the sales location of alcoholic beverages should be restricted, and for violating the provisions, the market supervision and management department will order the correction and impose a fine of 30,000 yuan.
In addition to â€œprohibition of alcoholâ€ , minors should also â€œmore exerciseâ€ .
According to the requirements of the consultation draft, the school should arrange more than an hour of student sports activities per day.
For online games, departments such as public security, public security, culture, radio and television tourism and sports, network supervision, and health should improve the health supervision system of Internet service business places, establish an online game health review system, and create a good communication space and communication culture in order to promote the healthy growth of young people.
In addition, the consultation draft also proposed that flu patients must wear masks in public places, and medical and health institutions should disclose the privacy of patients without their consent to a fine of 20,000 yuan.
It should be noted that in addition to the physical and mental health of the residents, the consultation draft also requires that all departments in Shenzhen should evaluate the impact of public policy implementation on the health of the population before formulating plans, such as urban spatial planning and construction, industrial park planning and construction, resource development utilization and ecological environment protection, biopharmaceutical industry development, as well as approving major construction projects and implementing major public service projects.
It shall not be formulated or approved for implementation without evaluation or assessment which will have a more serious negative impact on urban public health or the health of the residents.
