Recently, General Secretary Xi Jinping stressed during his visit to Jilin Province that it is necessary to strengthen the party's leadership, promote the extension of party organizations to the grass-roots level, improve the working system of grass-roots party organizations, and provide a strong guarantee for the governance of urban and rural communities.
Adhering to party building as a guide and implementing the party's leadership in all aspects of grass-roots governance is a fundamental requirement to do a good job in grass-roots governance.
To improve the level of grass-roots governance, it is necessary to adhere to the leadership of party building, strengthen political leadership, build a fighting bastion, and gather red forces, promote the party's political advantages, organizational advantages and mass work advantages into governance advantages, and transmit the party's forces and propositions to the "last mile of nerves".
Pay attention to calcium casting souls and strengthen political leadership.
To strengthen the political guidance of grass-roots governance, it is necessary to implement the "calcium casting soul" project.
It is necessary to deeply understand Xi Jinping's socialist ideas with Chinese characteristics in the new era as the primary task, take "not forgetting the original intention and remembering the mission" as the eternal issue of party construction and the lifelong topic of party members and cadres, strengthen the principle of reading the original text, and continue to promote the party's innovative theory of innovation through special training, batch training, discussion and exchange, holding a large lecture hall, and promote party members and cadres to further enhance the "four consciousnesses", strengthen the "four self-confidences" and achieve "two maintenance".
Through the combination of online and offline learning methods, we should broaden the channels of learning and education, and guide grass-roots party organizations and party members and cadres to truly integrate learning and education into their daily lives.
Pay attention to practical training, in the process of resolving key and difficult issues in the field of grass-roots governance, solve the troubles and troubles that the masses pay attention to, and temper the party's nature and ability.
Strengthen the norm and build a fighting fortress.
Grass-roots party organizations are both an important part of the grass-roots governance system and an important carrier of governance capabilities.
To promote the standardized construction of grass-roots party organizations, it is necessary to start from grasping the working regulations of the party branch, focusing on issues such as the weakening and virtualization of the leadership of the party organization, focusing on issues such as the weakening and weakening of the party organization, the establishment of an up-and-down linkage mechanism, an innovative branch setup form, the normalization and rectification of the weakness, the establishment of a sound decision-making deliberative mechanism, and the service to the masses.
In rural areas, we should strengthen the standardization and construction of village-level party organizations, standardize organizational forms, learning activities, and management mechanisms according to the standardized construction standards of party branches, and earnestly promote the detailed implementation of systems such as "three sessions and one lesson" and theme party day activities.
In the city, pay close attention to street communities, explore the form of innovative branch settings, focus on weak areas, "blocking points" and "pain points", and actively build an urban party building alliance, so that the party's work can achieve effective coverage.
At the same time, we will establish and improve the decision-making and deliberative mechanism led by grass-roots party organizations, improve the decision-making and deliberation mechanism led by major events, practical co-operations, urgent discussions, difficult solutions, and grass-roots party organizations, improve the mechanism for party members and cadres to contact and serve the masses, gather the hearts and minds of the people in the service of the people, enhance the sense of gain, happiness, honor and pride of party members, and make grass-roots governance more temperature.
Play a pioneering role and gather red power.
Grass-roots party members and cadres are the cornerstone of grass-roots governance.
Improve the governance ability at the grass-roots level, focus on improving the governance ability of grass-roots party members and cadres, pay attention to the demonstration and leading role of "red cells" in grass-roots governance, and unite the red forces at the forefront of contacting and serving the masses.
It is necessary to take the improvement of governance capabilities as a compulsory course for grass-roots party members and cadres, continuously strengthen ideological quenching, professional training, and practical exercise, carry forward the spirit of responsibility in the current position and urgent and dangerous tasks, so as to lay a solid foundation for promoting the modernization of the national governance system and governance capacity, and contribute to the promotion of the modernization of the national governance system and governance capacity.
It is necessary to carry out a wide range of "Community Whistle and Party Members Report" activities, participate in community construction, management and service by participating in theme party day activities, contacting difficult people, determining service items, claiming micro-wishes, and making reasonable suggestions, so that party members can play a role in community governance.
It is necessary to give full play to the role of non-working party members in rural areas, through the establishment of non-service party member vanguard posts, the formation of non-employed party members, etc., to guide the majority of grass-roots party members to actively participate in poverty alleviation, ecological construction, letter-and-visit stability maintenance, stalk prohibition and other work to better integrate red forces and serve the people.
The base building is strong.
The grass-roots party organization is the foundation of the ruling building.
It is only by persisting in strengthening the relationship between the party and the masses, increasing the well-being of the people, and taking party building guidance as a fundamental way to promote the innovation and development of grass-roots governance, we can build a solid foundation, so that grass-roots party organizations can pull it out and stand up, grass-roots party members and cadres can catch up and rush up, and promote grass-roots governance to have a "soul", orderly, powerful and effective.
