In 2020, the direct recruitment of non-commissioned officers will be fully carried out - Xinhua.com
BEIJING, July 26 (Reporter Jia Qilong) The Political Work Department of the Military Commission and the National Defense Mobilization Department recently jointly issued a notice to deploy non-commissioned non-commissioned non-commissioned non-commissioned officers directly from graduates of ordinary colleges and universities in 2020.
This year's direct recruitment of non-commissioned officers covers computers, automation, machinery and other more than 270 military general majors, focusing on the recruitment of unmanned aerial vehicles, navigation, aerospace, electronic information, small languages and other majors, the scale of recruitment increased by nearly 2,000 people compared with last year.
This year's direct recruitment of non-commissioned non-commissioned officers is synchronized with the organization, which begins on August 1 and ends on September 30.
Recognised young people can check the direct recruitment of non-commissioned officers through the national conscription network (http://www.gfbzb.gov.cn) to inquire about the direct recruitment of non-commissioned officers and the distribution of professional recruitment in various places, in accordance with the professional scope and recruitment conditions of online submission of registration information, and in accordance with the unified requirements of conscripted military service organs, to participate in follow-up recruitment work such as physical examination and political assessment.
Qualified young people who have not been recruited as non-commissioned officers due to professional and program restrictions can participate in the collection of compulsive soldiers, and when they are selected as non-commissioned non-commissioned officers at the end of compulsive military service, the number of years enrolled in ordinary higher education institutions in accordance with the prescribed academic system shall be regarded as the service time.
In this year's non-commissioned officer recruitment work will be uniformly organized by the conscription office of the people's governments at the provincial or prefecture-municipalities at the provincial or prefecture-municipalities, and will be selected on the basis of comprehensively measuring the academic level of the applicants, the achievements of professional courses during the school period, and obtaining professional qualification certificates; the scarcity of majors will be oriented towards local colleges and universities that meet the professional requirements and have the advantages of recruitment.
According to the normalized prevention and control requirements of the epidemic this year, this year's non-commissioned officers do not arrange to report for themselves in principle, and will synchronize with the conscripts to organize the transportation into the camp.
From September 1, 2020, the period of direct enlistment of non-commissioned non-commissioned officers will be held on December 1, 2020.
The receiving unit of the army will scientifically formulate a recruitment and professional training program, and earnestly organize the training; after the completion of the training, in accordance with the principle of professional counterparts and recruitment in a consistent manner, it will uniformly and accurately allocate non-commissioned non-commissioned non-commissioned non-commissioned non-commissioned officers to counterpart professional and technical positions.
