Free nucleic acid detection in Urumqi has been basically completed for secondary detection in high-risk areas
Urumqi, July 26 (Reporter Sun Tingwen Zhao Yamin) Zhang Wei, director of the Urumqi Municipal Health and Health Commission, reported the latest epidemic situation and nucleic acid detection in Urumqi on the 26th, saying that at present, most of the free nucleic acid detection work in Urumqi has been basically completed.
The expert group of the State Council and experts from the autonomous region and Urumqi are further evaluating the development of the epidemic based on nucleic acid detection and epidemiologic investigations.
The Information Office of the Xinjiang Uygur Autonomous Region held a press conference on the 26th to report on the epidemic and prevention and control situation in Xinjiang.
According to him, from 0:00 to 24:00 on July 25, there were 22 new confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia in Urumqi City (of which 5 were re-confirmed cases of asymptomatic infected people), and 38 new cases of asymptomatic infection.
As of 24:00 on July 25, there were 135 confirmed cases and 147 asymptomatic infected people in Urumqi.
The new asymptomatic infection on the 25th is also basically through the city's free nucleic acid testing and active screening.
Zhang Wei, director of the Urumqi Municipal Health and Health Commission, said on the 26th that the free nucleic acid detection work in Urum City has been basically completed.
He also said that from the experience in other parts of the country, there are a lot of factors that affect the nucleic acid test results, such as the sensitivity of detection reagents, the infection time and detoxification time of the tested personnel, the cooperation of the tested person when the specimen is taken (the difference in cooperation may cause the specimen to not be taken into place), as well as the testing environment and the operational proficiency of the inspectors.
For a variety of reasons, nucleic acid testing will also have false negative results.
The so-called false negative means that the tested person is indeed an infected person, but the nucleic acid test result is negative.
In addition, for people who have had close contact with confirmed cases and suspected cases, two nucleic acid tests are usually required to be ruled out.
For those who have been to the high-risk areas of the epidemic, if there are fever and respiratory symptoms, a negative nucleic acid test may be negative, so two nucleic acid tests are also required to be ruled out.
He said that in view of the above situation, for the health of the people of all ethnic groups in the city, starting from today, Urumqi City will carry out secondary free nucleic acid testing in key areas such as Tianshan District and Shaybak District, and at the same time carry out â€œinspection and Leakâ€.
It is reported that Tianshan District and Shayback District are high-risk areas of the epidemic.
The offline streamlined "cloud" is warm, the Shanghai International Film Festival reveals extraordinary industrial confidence-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-26 06:52:39 Source report Author:Wang Sishuo Responsibility Editor:Wang Sishuo
The offline streamlined "on the cloud" is enthusiastic, and the Shanghai International Film Festival shows extraordinary industrial confidence.
Yesterday, in the context of strict anti-epidemic measures, the 2020 Shanghai International Film and Television Festival opened the curtain of the 23rd Shanghai International Film Festival with an industrial summit forum of "comprehensive success and a dream new era".
As the first international film and television festival held since the continuous spread of the global epidemic and the normalization of China's epidemic prevention and control, this year's Shanghai International Film Festival is of great significance.
On the basis of doing a good job in the normalization of the prevention and control of the epidemic, the Shanghai International Film and Television Festival is not only a demonstration of confidence, but also a demonstration of our determination to overcome the epidemic - our determination to overcome the epidemic remains the same, the confidence determination to run the people's festival remains unchanged, and the determination to build a good global film and television innovation center and launch the "Shanghai culture" brand remains the same.
Every year, the Shanghai International Film Festival, with continuous innovation and continuous enterprising attitude, it is a new departure and a new beginning.
Therefore, it is necessary to take every step to serve the people's spiritual life and to serve the high-quality development of the film and television industry.
This is especially true this year.
In order to cherish the hard-won situation of epidemic prevention and control, the Shanghai International Film Festival, on the one hand, strictly abides by the requirements of epidemic prevention and control and implement the epidemic prevention and control measures; on the other hand, with the vision of gathering wisdom for Chinese film creation and meeting the viewing needs of moviegoers, the opening of online and offline multi-plate activities.
On the first day of the opening day, from the offline viewing to the industrial forum, the relevant activities of the film festival have strictly implemented the relevant epidemic prevention policies.
The activities of the forum are controlled by less than 50 people, and the attendance rate is strictly controlled within 30% for each viewing interval.
Just as the organizing committee of the film festival upholds, in any case, "putting the safety of people's lives and physical health first" is a big premise.
The offline activities have been greatly streamlined, and "on the cloud" has a lot of excitement.
In order to implement the important concept of "people's city, people's city for the people", as a festival of the people's masses, this year's Shanghai International Film Festival image innovation and transformation, with online "cloud screening", master class "cloud sharing" and other measures to meet the diverse needs of fans.
On the first day of the opening day, the film festival's official partner Mimi video and the Oriental People's Pearl Baishitong will return a number of "Belt and Road" films to fans.
On the same night, the opening forum and Jia Zhangke master class were also launched on various platforms such as central video, learning powerful countries, and cultural applications, so that the people can also pay attention to the latest trends in Chinese movies.
At yesterday's opening forum, Yan Xiaoming, a member of the party group and deputy director of the Central Radio and Television Station, delivered a speech and announced the opening of the film festival, Zhou Huilin, the Standing Committee of the Shanghai Municipal Party Committee and the Propaganda Affairs Department, delivered a speech, and the deputy mayor Zongming attended.
White House epidemic expert Fauci: cautiously optimistic about the development of a vaccine in early 2021
Fauci made the remarks at an online video conference hosted by the International Leadership Foundation on the 25th.
He cautioned that it’s not clear how the new coronavirus outbreak will develop in the fall and winter, or what the ultimate impact will be, “and the only way to end this is that each of us chooses to be a part of the solution.”
According to the data of Johns Hopkins University in the United States, as of 21:00 on the 25th, the number of new crown confirmed cases in the United States has reached 4.176 million, with 146,000 deaths.
Fauci said that some parts of the United States are currently struggling with the rebound of the epidemic.
Although the epidemics are different in various places and require tailor-made response solutions, diversified anti-epidemic strategies do not mean that there is no close connection between the regions.
An outbreak in one region will eventually affect other regions.
“It’s not a time for complacency,” Fauci said, “and our work is not done, we must intensify our efforts, and we must be vigilant about the uncertainty of the future.”
He Dayi, a Chinese-American medical expert and the founder of "cocktail therapy" to treat AIDS, pointed out at the meeting that the new crown epidemic in the United States has not yet reached its peak.
“Each of us must do everything in our power to reduce the spread of the virus.”
He called on the public to use their own practical actions to buy time for scientists to step up the research and development of new crown treatment drugs and vaccines.
The International Leadership Foundation is a not-for-profit organization that promotes international exchange activities in the United States and the Asia-Pacific region, and is committed to promoting the status of Asian-Americans in the United States and cultivating young international leaders.
On the same day, U.S. Transportation Secretary Zhao Xiaolan, U.S. Congressman Meng Zhaowen, U.S. Representative Meng Zhaowen, and Dong Jiling, founding president of the International Leadership Foundation, spoke at the meeting.
In particular, they paid homage to the anti-epidemic medical workers and volunteers in the front line, and called on the American public to continue adhering to anti-epidemic norms such as "social distancing" to curb the spread of the epidemic.
Dalian: There are no new local confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia, 24 new cases of asymptomatic infection
Xinhua News Agency, Dalian, July 25 (Reporter Cai Yongjun, Cui Shihao) Dalian issued a message on the 25th, from 15:00 on July 24 to 14:00 on July 25th, there were no new locally confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia in Dalian, with 24 new asymptomatic infections and no new suspected cases.
At 14:00 from July 22nd to 25th, a total of 12 local confirmed cases of new crown pneumonia were reported in the city, all of which were centrally isolated and treated in Dalian Sixth People's Hospital.
Zhao Lian, deputy director of the Dalian Municipal Health and Health Commission, said that according to the situation of the epidemic situation, the medical staff of the city's third-level hospitals were organized to enter the street community, opened more than 600 sampling points in Dalian Bay, workers' villages, light rail routes, and some key areas of Jinpu New District, fully promoted personnel nucleic acid screening, and dispatched nearly 2,000 medical personnel to carry out nucleic acid testing and sampling every day.
As of 14:00 on July 25, more than 210,000 people had been sampled in the city.
Among the current 12 confirmed cases in Dalian, 10 of the 12 confirmed cases are employees of Dalian Kaiyang World Seafood Co., Ltd.; 46 of the 54 asymptomatic infected people are employees of the company and the families of their relatives; among all the positive cases of nucleic acid test, the proportion of employees of the company and the families of their relatives has reached 85%.
Based on research and judgment, the city of Dalian decided to strengthen the strict control of close contacts and close contacts of all employees of Dalian Kaiyang World Seafood Co., Ltd., and implement centralized isolation medical observation and at least 2 nucleic acid tests on the 14th.
At the same time, the city of Dalian decided to further expand the scope of centralized isolation of medical observers, close contacts of nucleic acid positive persons (including cases and asymptomatic infected persons), close contacts of close contacts of close contacts of close contacts, 14 days of centralized isolation medical observation and at least 2 nucleic acid tests.
Dalian airport and Dalian railway station issued a notice on the 25th, the city's personnel in principle to implement non-necessary non-departure, it is really necessary to leave the connection, must hold a 7-day kernel acid test negative certificate; Dalian bus passenger terminal since the 25th 12 o'clock to suspend the city's all line ticket sales, the specific recovery time will be notified separately.
Brazilian study shows hydroxychloroquine is ineffective in the treatment of neocorenical pneumococcal disease
Recently, a Brazilian study showed that hydroxychloroquine is not effective for patients with new crown pneumonia with mild and medium disease.
The study was published in the New England Journal of Medicine.
Pakistani researchers divided 667 patients from 55 hospitals across the country into three clinical trials, mainly comparing the treatment effect of hydroxychloroquine alone or in combination with other antibiotic azithromycin, and analyzing whether it could help to improve the condition of mild and moderate patients with new crown pneumonia.
The results showed that hydroxychloroquine not only has no therapeutic effect, but it may have harmful side effects on the organs.
The research was carried out by a number of authoritative Brazilian hospitals such as the Hospital Israelita Albert Einstein (Hospital Israelita Albert Einstein), the Cardiology Hospital (HCor), the Syrian Lebanese Hospital (Hospital Sírio-Libanês), and the Brazilian Clinical Research Institute (BRICNet).
On the 25th local time, Brazil's President Bolsonaro announced through the social platform that the fourth nucleic acid test result was negative.
Bolsonaro has been taking hydroxychloroquine during the period of the infection and has actively promoted it many times.
Journalist Zhao Yijun
The four departments carry out a new round of app governance to protect the security of personal information
BEIJING, July 25 (Reporters Yu Junjie and Chen Aiping) The reporter learned from the National Network Information Office on the 25th that in 2020, the management of personal information collection and use of personal information by the App in violation of the law was officially launched recently, focusing on cracking down on strong problems such as the private uploading of personal information.
It is reported that this round of App governance is carried out by the four departments of the National Network Information Office, the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology, the Ministry of Public Security and the State Administration of Market Supervision.
According to reports, a special governance working group composed of four departments received more than 12,000 pieces of effective information reported by netizens last year, verified for more than 2,300 apps, and took measures such as public exposure, interviews, and removal of 260 apps with large-scale users and outstanding problems.
According to the relevant person in charge of the National Cyber Security Office, the current number of apps has exceeded 5 million, and the problem of collecting and using personal information has not yet been fundamentally solved.
In 2020, the governance work will further strengthen its efforts to further expand the scope of governance to the SDK (software development kit) and small programs on the basis of app verification.
It is reported that the working group will carry out thematic research and in-depth testing on issues such as the irregular collection and use of personal biometric information and the abuse of sensitive permissions by apps, focusing on the abuse of permissions such as recording and photography.
Depending on the circumstances of the problem and the severity of the consequences, the working group will impose penalties such as interviews, warnings, delistings and fines in accordance with the law, which will form an effective deterrent to illegal activities.
It is understood that the working group plans to formulate guidelines for the review and management of the app collection and use of personal information, and guide and urge the application store to do a good job of pre-app audit of the app on-line, and to strictly close the entrance.
In addition, the working group will also issue free technical tools to guide small and medium-sized enterprises to carry out self-testing and evaluation, and improve the legal compliance of small and medium-sized enterprise personal information collection and use activities.
Johns Hopkins University: the world's cumulative new crown confirmed more than 16 million cases
NEW YORK, July 26 (Xinhua) -- The statistics of the new crown epidemic released by Johns Hopkins University on the 26th show that as of 2:40 U.S. Eastern Time on the 26th (14:40 Beijing time), the cumulative number of new crown confirmed cases in the world has reached 16,048,100 cases, with a total of 64,537 deaths.
According to the data, the United States is the country with the worst epidemic in the world, with a cumulative number of confirmed cases and 146,460 cumulative deaths.
The total number of confirmed cases in Brazil is 2394,513 and the cumulative number of deaths is 86,449, which is second only to the United States.
Countries with more than 300,000 cumulative confirmed cases include India, Russia, South Africa, Mexico, Peru, Chile and the United Kingdom.
On the 25th, the 2020 Hunan Red Tourism and Culture Festival and Xiangtan's first Red Cultural Industry Expo kicked off in Shaoshan.
In the past few years, the demand for red tourism has gradually increased.
However, the development of the red tourism industry is also facing difficulties such as fewer young groups, homogenization of tour projects, and single commercialization channels.
In particular, this year's epidemic raid, the country's cultural and tourism industry has suffered serious setbacks, and red tourist attractions are also facing serious challenges.
For example, the use of drone shooting, VR immersive experience and other scientific and technological means, you can to meet the tourist needs of tourists "people have not arrived, the scenery has arrived"; the introduction of online live broadcast means, the promotion of red scenic spot's famous special products, can directly enhance the economic benefits of red tourism; the introduction of "cloud" technology, to create high-quality exhibitions with outstanding themes, sharp guidance, rich connotation, fully show and enhance the publicity function of the red scenic spots.
This cultural festival uses the popular "county and city (district) chief + professional anchor special promotion" method to promote red cultural tourism specialties, the use of 5G technology to provide real-time viewing and smart city demonstration and other services to promote the red cultural tourism attractions, are trying to insert smart wings for red tourism, looking forward to Hunan red tourism is more and more popular.
U.S.-U.S.-China trade talks to meet in August
Hong Kong's "South China Morning Post" quoted an anonymous person familiar with the matter reported on the 25th that the head of China's trade negotiation team, Vice Premier Liu He and the U.S. team's co-leader and trade representative Lai Haizhe are expected to hold formal talks in August to assess the implementation of the first phase of the Sino-US trade agreement between the two sides.
The report said that although China has significantly increased the amount of U.S. agricultural purchases in the past few months, due to factors such as the new coronavirus epidemic, China's purchases are still some distance from the amount promised in the trade agreement.
Analysts say the recent U.S.-China closure of each other’s consulates, along with other disputes, could undermine any progress on trade.
A month after the first phase of the U.S.-China trade deal was signed on Jan. 15, it stipulated that a high-level trade framework group between the two sides should hold semi-annual talks.
People familiar with the matter said that the meeting will be an "important turning point", allowing the two sides to assess the progress of the agreement.
However, the source also said that if U.S.-China tensions lead to a low willingness to hold talks at this time, the two sides may agree that Lai Haizhe's teleconference with Liu on May 8 has met the terms of the semi-annual talks in the trade agreement.
Since the beginning of this year, Sino-US relations have deteriorated rapidly, and the dispute between the two sides includes a series of issues such as the origin of the new coronavirus, trade, Hong Kong, Xinjiang, the South China Sea and ideology.
U.S. President Donald Trump bragged about his achievements in the first phase of the agreement at the beginning of the year, but his attitude has changed recently.
On the 23rd, he said at a press conference at the White House that although China recently purchased a record-breaking amount of U.S. corn on a single-day basis, it also bought a lot of soybeans, "but this trade agreement now means less to me than when it was originally reached."
An anonymous Beijing government adviser also believes that the new round of trade negotiations is unlikely to take place due to poor U.S.-China relations, and "trade issues have lost weight in China-U.S. relations."
However, he revealed that China's economic and trade-related units still met on the 23rd to discuss a series of issues, including how to increase imports from the United States, "we have done our best to buy, so any additional procurement will be difficult."
Peng Jiening, vice chairman of the U.S.-China Business Council, said it was "more important than ever" to maintain the momentum of the first phase of the agreement, noting that China has made progress this year in further opening its financial markets to U.S. companies.
Plenum, an analyst at an independent research firm, said: “It’s better to talk than not, even if it’s just routine.”
BEIJING, July 26 (Reporter Wei Yukun) The reporter learned from the Ministry of Emergency Management on the 26th that the State Defense Office and the Ministry of Emergency Management, together with the State Food and Material Reserve Bureau, have once again urgently transferred 1.35 million woven bags, 1.2 million square meters of woven fabrics, and 130,000 square meters of geotechnical fabrics and other six types of central reserve flood control materials to Anhui to support Anhui's flood relief and rescue work.
According to the relevant person in charge of the Ministry of Emergency Management, at present, the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River and the Huai River Basin maintain high-level fluctuation, and the No. 3 flood of the Yangtze River in 2020 was formed in the upper reaches of the Yangtze River on the 26th, and the risk in local areas has increased.
The meteorological department is expected to have heavy rainfall in Chongqing, Guizhou and the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River in the next three days, and the flood control situation is still severe and complicated.
According to reports, the Ministry of Emergency Management has deployed a national comprehensive fire rescue team to pre-position professional rescue forces in key flood control areas, participated in a total of 10,364 kinds of anti-flood rescue and rescue, dispatched more than 130,000 soldiers, 17,778 fire engines, 11,887 boats and boats, rescuing 37,777 people in distress, evacuating and transferring more than 107,000 trapped people.
Nasdaq China Chief Representative Hao Yusheng: It is now the best time for Chinese companies to go to the U.S. IPO - Economic Watch - Professional financial news website
Economic Observer Network reporter Zhang Bin because of Luckin coffee counterfeiting incident, the U.S. market on the implementation of more stringent supervision, coupled with long-term pressure on the valuation, listed in the United States in the United States of medium-sized stocks to feel the pressure, NetEase, Jingdong and other medium-sized stocks have recently begun to return to Hong Kong listing journey.
In the near future, companies such as seashells and ideal cars have high enthusiasm for listing in the United States.
Under the crisis of the epidemic and medium-sized stocks, is it the best time for Chinese enterprises to go public in the United States?
"In terms of the recent IPO cases and the upcoming companies going to the U.S. to go to the U.S. to go to the U.S. IPO has not had any impact, but now the market is very good, and even now this point is the best time for Chinese companies to go to the U.S. IPO in the past 10 years."
The chief representative of the Nasdaq Stock Exchange in China said at the "2020 Listed Company Leaders Summit" hosted by Snowball.
In April, the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission (PCAOB) issued a statement on the critical role of audit quality and regulatory access to auditing and other international information—discussions about the current challenges of access to information among U.S.-listed companies with a significant presence in China.
Although there has been a significant increase in international cooperation and coordination in recent years, U.S. regulators continue to face legal and practical legal and practical challenges to the SEC and PCAOB, which, in response to the document, is a detailed list of listed companies that have encountered audit hurdles, as well as a large number of equity companies.
In addition, in May of this year, the U.S. Senate passed the Foreign Company Accountability Act, which imposes additional information disclosure requirements on the listing of foreign companies in the United States.
In the view of Hao Yusheng, the stock crisis did not affect the appetite of investors.
"When the news just came out, it caused everyone's panic, and everyone was asking whether they could go to the United States in the future, but then we found out that these problems were not a matter for investors, and investors may ask these questions when they recently went to the U.S. IPO, and even become a standardized problem, but this has not been regarded by investors as an important factor in investing and not investing in a Chinese company."
It is recommended that you look at the current situation in a common way.
Of course, this may seem to be the worst situation in the past two years, but in terms of the appetite of investors, there is no impact.
So from now until the end of this year or before the U.S. general election, the upsurge of IPOs in the United States will continue.”
On May 9 of this year, Jinshan Cloud was officially listed on the NASDAQ in the United States, becoming the first Chinese company to IPO in the United States after the epidemic.
"The listing of Jinshan Cloud gives great confidence to the Chinese companies that are preparing for the IPO."
Hao Yusheng said.
Snowball's stock data report in the first half of 2020 shows that in the first half of this year, there were a total of 20 Chinese IPOs in the United States, an increase of 17.6% over the same period last year; in terms of the total amount of initial fundraising, 20 companies raised a total of 2.725 billion yuan, up more than 52.4% compared with the same period last year; In terms of industry distribution, the number of IPOs in the health care industry in the first half of this year was outstanding, an increase of 100% over the same period last year.
In the first half of this year, the Chinese companies that went to the United States for IPOs were of high quality, and high-quality companies with strong fundamentals and growth would be more favored by investors.
In the short, medium-term and long-term terms, Hao Yusheng continues to be optimistic about Ming's Chinese company's IPO in the United States.
"In the short term, the IPO boom in the United States is still continuing; in the medium term, Chinese companies have more choices, A-shares, Hong Kong stocks and U.S. stocks, everyone will take the U.S. election and Sino-U.S. relations as a consideration of market choices and time choices; in the long run, everything will return to the norm, market fluctuations are cycles, there are both political cycles and economic cycles.
"There are a lot of uncertainties this year, but for high-quality companies, no matter whether the market is good or bad, as long as they are solid and there is growth that investors can see, other factors are relatively minor, and investors need to invest in excellent Chinese companies."
BEIJING, July 26 (Reporter Gao Kai) On the evening of July 25, the "dance of life" of the National Grand Theatre's "Summer Flower" series of concerts was synchronized online and offline as scheduled, and the conductor Yang Yang and pianist Zhang Haochen cooperated on the same stage with the National Grand Theatre Orchestra to play Rachmaninov's "Second Piano Concerto" and "symphonic dance music".
At the same time, located in the sub-center of the Beijing city, the National Grand Theatre Taihu Theater also ushered in the first offline performance since the anti-epidemic, the conductor Zheng Jian and the National Grand Theatre Choir passionately sang the "Taiwan Lake Weekly Concert" of the military choral music concert.
In accordance with the city's epidemic prevention and control requirements and the spirit of the city's relevant departments' documents, the National Grand Theatre, in accordance with the principle of "prudent openness and gradual liberalization", the concert was performed on July 25, with limited ticket sales to the public for the first time.
Jin Hui, head of the marketing department of the National Grand Theatre, said: "This is the first performance project sold by the National Grand Theatre to the audience since the beginning of the epidemic.
In accordance with the relevant requirements of epidemic prevention and control, the real-name sales and admission of "one person, one vote, one card and one code" are implemented, and the number of sales does not exceed 30% of the entire seat.
Subsequently, performances and artistic activities such as the drama "Xiwang Chang'an", the special planning concert of the August 1st Military Festival, and opera films will also continue to sell limited tickets to the public."
The concert on July 25 also continued to be synchronized on the classical music channel and a number of online platforms of the National Theatre, and as of 12 o'clock on the evening of the 25th, the online broadcast of the concert exceeded 30 million.
That night, the concert was opened at the opening of the piano bell at the beginning of the "Rade II", and this is the first time that the piano concerto was dedicated to the spectators for the first time.
With his deep and condensed understanding, Zhang played the first theme full of sadness and entanglement of the works, under Yang Yang's direction, the orchestra and the piano in the ups and downs of competition and compromise to create endless auditory enjoyment.
After going through the "silent water" of the second movement and the "big carnival" of the third movement, more than a hundred spectators burst into warm applause in the emotion of returning to the scene, and the online audience also expressed sincere admiration in the form of barrages and comments.
Later, Zhang Haochen gave back to the audience with a song's re-enactment of Chopin's "Ascension C minor nocturne" to the audience.
After a brief adjustment of the stage, Yang Yang conducted the orchestra of the National Grand Théâtre of Rachmaninoff's last large-scale orchestra symphony, in which the composer presented a more introspect of emotion and integrated into his new inspiration and memories of past creations and homelands.
In Yang Yang's calm and calm treatment, the melancholy temperament and magnificent atmosphere of this work have been revealed, and the orchestra will also Rachmaninoff's "last spark" dazzling.
The preliminaries of this concert once again brought unexpected surprises to the audience.
CCTV "news simulcast" anchor Gangqiang came to the backstage makeup room of the National Grand Theatre, for everyone to reveal Gergiev, Lang Lang and other music masters in front of the "stronghold", then he came to the public space on the first floor of the National Grand Theatre, in front of the three nine-foot piano with the story of Yang Yang, Zhang Haochen and the National Grand Theatre harbinger in the fast dialogue, Gang Qiang with a senior piano lover's perspective to discuss the maintenance and maintenance of the piano.
That night, at the Taihu Amphitheatre of the National Grand Theatre, the military chorus song concert kicked off in the melodious "Don't forget the original heart".
This is the first performance since the anti-epidemic of the National Grand Theatre's "Taiwan Lake Weekly Concert".
It is reported that on August 1, the conductor Zheng Jian will also continue to bring "warrior and the motherland" with the National Grand Theatre choir - the choral concert of the National Grand Theatre Celebrating the August 1 Army Building Festival, as a series of online performances of "sound like summer flowers", synchronously live through the Internet, and pay tribute to the soldiers who defend the motherland in the classic song.
Heilongjiang half a year to deal with drunk driving 22,000 - Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Harbin, July 26 (Reporter Liang Shubin) The reporter learned from the traffic police headquarters of the Heilongjiang Provincial Public Security Department that in the first half of this year, the public security traffic control departments in various parts of Heilongjiang Province investigated and dealt with a total of 22,000 cases.
In recent days, when the Hegang traffic police were on duty at the service station, a driver saw the traffic police on duty and threw the car and ran.
The police on duty quickly chased and arrested the suspect Wang in the warehouse of a villager's house.
The on-site test result of the exhaled alcohol tester is 28.4mg/100 ml, and Wang is driving a motor vehicle after drinking.
The police issued a fine of 2,000 yuan, suspended motor vehicle driver's license for 6 months and a driver's license with 12 points of administrative penalties.
Since the beginning of this year, the public security traffic control department of Heilongjiang Province has continuously rectified the illegal and criminal acts of drunk driving, "drinking and not driving, driving not drinking" has become the social consensus.
In the first half of this year, the public security traffic control departments in various places investigated and dealt with a total of 22,000 cases of drunk driving, of which 3,744 were intoxicated.
Chongqing Wulong mountain landslide to form the local emergency transfer of more than 500 people-Xinhua
Xinhua News Agency, Chongqing, July 26 (Reporters Zhou Wenchun and Ke Gaoyang) The reporter learned from the Wulong District Government of Chongqing on the 26th that heavy rains caused landslides in the local area and the formation of dyke lakes, and more than 500 people urgently transferred.
Affected by the continuous rainfall, since July 22, a large-scale slip and deflection has occurred since July 22, a large-scale sliding and deformation of the soil after the landslide in the Zhongtai group in the Zhongtai group in Wulong District has fallen into the Wujiang tributary along the Cang River.
On the 25th, there were heavy rainfall weather processes in the local area, and landslides were further expanded, resulting in the interruption of village road road traffic, and completely blocked along the Cang River, forming a dam with a water level of 13 meters and a storage capacity of about 420,000 cubic meters.
According to on-site investigation and monitoring, the landslide volume is about 1.3 million cubic meters, which is still in an unstable state, there are scattered stones, and there has been a dam overflow, and there is a risk of embankment, which poses a threat to downstream power stations and field towns.
After the danger, the local government organized the evacuation of residents along the river overnight and urgently transferred the masses to a safe area.
At present, 162 households and 520 people have been evacuated from the insurance area, and the disposal of the lake is still in progress.
Reuters: Alibaba’s founder Jack Ma has been subpoenaed by an Indian court.
A former Indian employee of Alibaba’s UC browser has been sued for censoring the company for censoring the company’s apps and disprorisive content, as a result of which he was laid off.
The ex-employee also came up with a number of screenshots as evidence, saying that Alibaba’s UC News App published fake news about India, especially the title section.
He also said that an application called the UC Web will review content that contains keywords such as the Sino-Indian border and the Sino-Indian war.
According to court documents, a civil judge at a district court in New Delhi’s satellite city of Gulugram has issued subpoenas to Alibaba, Ma and more than a dozen other individuals or companies asking them to appear in court on July 29 or through a lawyer.
On June 29, India’s Ministry of Electronic Information and Technology announced a ban on 59 Chinese apps, including UC News, the UC browser, TikTok, WeChat and Weibo, citing security concerns.
People's Daily commentator: Concentrate on doing your own thing to create a new advantage for future development - on learning and implementing General Secretary Xi Jinping's important speech at the entrepreneur symposium - Xinhua
BEIJING, July 25 ( Xinhua) People's Daily July 26 commentator article: Concentrate on doing their own things to create new advantages for future development
At present, the global epidemic and the world economic situation are still severe and complex, and the challenges facing China's development are unprecedented.
Maintaining our strategic focus, enhancing our confidence, and focusing on doing our own thing is the key to our ability to deal with a variety of risks and challenges.
At the entrepreneur symposium held recently, General Secretary Xi Jinping stressed that in the current external environment of rising protectionism, sluggish world economy and shrinking global market, we must focus on doing our own thing, give full play to the advantages of the domestic ultra-large-scale market, and gradually form a new development pattern with domestic large-scale cycles as the main body and domestic and international dual-cycle mutual promotion, enhance the modernization level of the industrial chain supply chain, vigorously promote scientific and technological innovation, accelerate key core technologies, and create new advantages for future development.
Worship is wise, the scoundrum wins.
In the external environment of the in-depth development of economic globalization, markets and resources have played an important role in China's rapid development.
At present, the world under the impact of the epidemic is undergoing profound changes, facing more unstable and uncertain factors, and economic globalization is encountering headwinds and waves.
Do a long time to deal with the changes in the external environment of the thinking and work preparation, to promote China's economy to ride the waves, a very important aspect is to expand and meet domestic demand as a strategic basis for development, give full play to their own advantages, through the prosperity of the domestic economy, unimpeded domestic cycle to add impetus to China's economic development, to drive the world economic recovery.
We must deeply understand that the construction of a complete domestic demand system is related to the long-term development of our country's long-term development and long-term stability.
The Party Central Committee reviewed the situation and clearly put forward to firmly implement the strategy of expanding domestic demand, which is the need to cope with the impact of the epidemic, the need to maintain the long-term sustainable and healthy development of China's economy, but also to meet the people's growing needs for a better life.
The advantage of a large-scale economy is that it can be recycled internally.
With the world's most complete and largest industrial system, strong production capacity and perfect supporting capacity, with more than 100 million market players and more than 170 million people with higher education or all kinds of professional skills, as well as an ultra-large-scale domestic demand market formed by 1.4 billion people, including more than 400 million middle-income groups, it is in the stage of rapid development of new industrialization, informatization, urbanization and agricultural modernization.
Public ownership as the main body, a variety of ownership of the common development of the economy, according to labor distribution as the main body, a variety of distribution methods coexist, the socialist market economic system and other socialist basic economic system, not only to stimulate the vitality of all kinds of market entities, liberation and the development of social productive forces, but also to promote efficiency and fair and organic unity, and continue to achieve common prosperity.
We must firmly grasp the strategic base of expanding domestic demand, so that all aspects of production, distribution and circulation rely more on the domestic market to achieve a virtuous circle, clarify the strategic direction of supply-side structural reform, and promote the dynamic balance between total supply and demand at a higher level.
It is necessary to accelerate the construction of a complete domestic demand system, vigorously promote scientific and technological innovation and other aspects of innovation, accelerate the promotion of strategic emerging industries such as digital economy, intelligent manufacturing, life and health, and new materials, form more new growth points and growth poles, and gradually form a new development pattern with domestic large-scale circulation as the main body and domestic and international dual-cycle mutual promotion.
Openness leads to progress, and closure is bound to lag behind.
General Secretary Xi Jinping has repeatedly stressed that China's open door will not be closed, it will only open wider and wider.
Taking the domestic large-scale circulation as the main body, it is by no means closing the door and closing the operation, but by giving full play to the potential of domestic demand to better connect the domestic market and the international market, and making better use of the two domestic and international markets and two kinds of resources to achieve a stronger and more sustainable development.
At the same time, there is no contradiction between expanding domestic demand and expanding openness, and the smoother the domestic cycle, the more conducive it is to build a new pattern of opening-up, and the more conducive it is to form new advantages of participating in international cooperation and competition.
Although the current trend of international protectionism is rising, we must stand on the right side of history, persist in deepening reform and expanding opening-up, strengthen open cooperation in the field of science and technology, promote the construction of an open world economy, and promote the construction of a community with a shared future for mankind.
The history of the Chinese nation has experienced a lot of tribulations, but it has never been crushed, but it has become more and more courageous, and has continued to grow in the ordeal and rise from the tribulations.
On the way forward, with the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee with Comrade Xi Jinping as the core, with the significant advantages of the socialist system with Chinese characteristics, strong mobilization capabilities and strong comprehensive strength, and the unity and struggle of the people of all ethnic groups in the whole army, we will surely be able to overcome all difficulties and obstacles, maintain the momentum of China's good economic and social development, build a well-off society in an all-round way, and successfully start a new journey of building a socialist modern country in an all-round!
The return of the balance of the "post-90s" instead of "revengeful" savings?
With the decline of the balance treasure income, the "post-90s" not only did not escape the balance treasure, but began to "retaliatoryly" saving money.
In the first half of the first half of the year, the post-90 savings report (2020 version) released by the China New Economic Research Institute and Alipay showed that in the first half of the year, the "post-90s" preferred to save money: the per capita saving amount increased by nearly 40% compared with 2019.
What is interesting is that the "post-90s" are more inclined to save from a "small money", and 60% of the average amount of money saved is less than 20 yuan.
With the balance to save money, it has also become a "post-90s" saving habit.
According to the data, among the 700 million balance treasure users, there are 134 million users who are "post-90s".
In China, there are 174 million "post-90s", that is to say, about three out of every four "post-90s" in the country.
At present, the seven-day annualized return rate of monetary funds such as balance treasure has fallen to about 1.5% from a level higher than 2% at the beginning of the year.
Even so, it did not affect the "post-90s" saving pace.
In the context of the improvement of the "save the money-saving effect", many young people who are accustomed to using the balance treasure are also directly transformed into "genetic people".
Alipay data show that as of July 13th, nearly a month of Alipay's new "genuine people" has more than doubled year-on-year, and more and more young people have achieved "advanced" financial management on Alipay.
Some analysts believe that the flow of funds into the stock market is also an important reason for the clear decline in the share of the monetary fund in June.
The report also shows that "post-90s" girls are more inclined to save more money, an average of 20% higher than the amount of money saved by boys; among the users who hold funds on the Alipay platform, 60% are male, and women tend to choose a more robust financial management method compared with men.
What do you plan to do after the “post-90s”?
Alipay data show that the "post-90s" have the habit of saving money for the goal, and the largest number of users who use travel as the goal of saving money.
Affected by the impact of the epidemic, many "post-90s" saved money to prepare for post-epidemic travel; the reopening of movie theaters also provided a new way to move from saving money to consumption.
