APEC trade ministers say it will speed up regional economic recovery - Xinhua News Agency
KUALA LUMPUR, July 25 (Xinhua) (Xinhua) -- A video conference of trade ministers of the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) members was held on the 25th and promised to work to reduce the impact of the new coronavirus epidemic on the region's economy and accelerate the realization of a resilient, sustainable and inclusive regional economic recovery.
The meeting will be chaired by Malaysia, the organizer of this year's informal meeting of APEC leaders.
APEC trade ministers recognize the importance of a free, open, equitable, non-discriminatory, transparent and predictable trade and investment environment at this challenging time for economic recovery.
We are committed to ensuring that the urgent measures taken in response to the epidemic are targeted, appropriate, transparent and temporary, do not create unnecessary trade barriers and disrupt global supply chains, while complying with World Trade Organization rules.
In his statement, the trade ministers pledged to strengthen cooperation to facilitate the movement of necessary goods and services, promote connectivity by enhancing supply chain resilience, and minimizing disruptions to the flow of medical supplies, food and agricultural products in response to the outbreak.
The trade ministers of APEC member countries agreed on the need to discuss how to reduce non-tariff barriers that restrict trade in essential goods and reiterated their commitment to facilitating the necessary cross-border movement of people without prejudice to the measures taken to stop the spread of the epidemic.
The meeting also issued a declaration on promoting the circulation of essential commodities.
Economies will ensure that their trade measures in response to the epidemic are in line with WTO rules and commit to take action to reduce non-tariff trade barriers and trade facilitation to facilitate the flow of necessary goods under the epidemic.
Malaysian Minister of International Trade and Industry Azmin Ali, who chaired the meeting, said that despite the impact of the epidemic, Malaysia is committed to promoting the success of this year's APEC meeting, and the formulation of the post-2020 APEC cooperation vision is progressing in an orderly manner.
Malaysia agreed to hold APEC-related meetings by videoconference, but did not rule out the possibility of arranging substantive meetings during the APEC Economic Leaders’ Meeting at the end of the year.
A total of Thirteen people have tested positive by the Ministry of Public Information of the Philippine Presidential Office - Sino-Singapore Network
(Combating the new crown pneumonia) A total of 13 people in the Philippine presidential palace news department have tested positive
MANILA, July 26 (Reporter Guan Xiangdong) The Ministry of Public Information (PCOO) issued a notice on the 25th that Minister Martin Andanal received a negative test for new crown pneumonia on the 24th.
As of the afternoon of the same day, the PCOO has accumulatively 13 employees who have tested positive, after three positive people and two are still receiving medical treatment.
Due to contacts with an infected PCOO employee, Andanar and 49 PCOO employees were tested for new crown pneumonia on the 24th.
According to the report released on the 25th, 10 of the employees tested positive.
Marvin Gatpayat, vice minister of administrative and legal affairs of the PCOO, said that the ministry's new administrative office building in the presidential palace was originally scheduled to resume office on the same day of President Duterte's fifth State of the Union speech on the 27th.
On the same day, Martin Andzanar assured the public that PCOO continues to fulfill its responsibilities to the people of the Philippines to ensure the timely provision of important information to the public, while strengthening contact tracing and testing to avoid the further spread of the new crown pneumonia virus among PCOO employees, and he prayed for the rapid recovery of employees who tested positive.
According to the Philippine Department of Health, there were 2019 new confirmed cases in the country on the same day, with a total of 78,412 cases, of which 50,763 were still sick, nearly 90% were mild, 9% were asymptomatic, and less than 1% were severe and critical.
France to increase military investment in space - Xinhua
French Defense Minister Florence Parly said on the 24th that France will add hundreds of millions of euros to the space defense budget, the development of space military forces, in order to prevent other countries may carry out "unfriendly moves" in outer space.
On the same day, Parly told Provence that between 2019 and 2025, the expenditure budget for France's space military projects will increase from the previously proposed 3.6 billion euros ($4.2 billion) to 4.3 billion euros ($5 billion).
According to the French military planning bill 2019-2025 approved by the French parliament in 2018, France is expected to update the existing observation satellites and communication satellites in the future, launch three electromagnetic listening satellites, and improve the modernization level of space surveillance radars.
French President Emmanuel Emmanuel Emmanuel Emmanuel Macron announced in July last year that there would be a space military command and an “aeronautics and space force” within the French air force.
Parly said she would formally announce the creation of the Space Force when she visits a military academy in Sarlon, Provence.
Parly said that the space force belongs to the air force and has a capacity of 500 personnel by 2025.
“There’s no longer any thought that space serves the common interests of science, it’s gone. Now space is the place where countries fight for global hegemony,” she said.
Parly reiterated Macron's previous remarks, saying that the French side has no intention of provoking an arms race.
“We are by no means engaged in an arms race, but I have a responsibility to be fully aware of the threats we may face.”
Parly revisited the surveillance of a military satellite shared by France and Italy in 2017.
Peeping is a Russian satellite, she said.
The Russian side denies this claim.
Parly said France would “soon” have small patrol satellites capable of reconnouncing and enslaving “the black hands behind unfriendly moves.”
The French media believes that the reason why France seeks to establish a Space Force is because US President Donald Trump asked the US Department of Defense in February last year to draw up a space force bill.
In December last year, Trump signed a national defense authorization bill to approve the creation of the sixth largest U.S. military service, the Space Force.
Some experts are concerned that the U.S. measures have accelerated the militarization of U.S. space, which could lead to a new space arms race.
Xinhua News Agency, Hohhot, July 26 (Reporter Jia Lijun) The reporter learned at the Yellow River Haibo Bay Water Conservancy Hub Administration that in the past few days, Haibo Bay Water Conservancy Hub has actively defused the No. 2 floods this year, and as of the afternoon of the 26th, the upstream amount of water and the amount of unloaded water were the same, and the monitoring data were normal.
In order to cope with the flood process, the Huanghe Haibowan Water Conservancy Hub in Wuhai City, Inner Mongolia Autonomous Region, gradually reduced the water level of the reservoir from 0:00 on July 23, the discharge flow rate was not more than 3,000 cubic meters per second, and the water level was reduced to 1071 meters before the dam, vacating the flood reservoir capacity.
At the same time, start the sand scheduling application.
In the past few days, the Yellow River Haibowan Water Conservancy Hub Administration has paid close attention to the development and changes of water conditions and flood season for 24 hours, strengthened the operation of reservoirs and the safety management of dams, and strengthened the inspection and protection work on the left and right banks and important parts of the reservoir, especially insurance sections, to ensure the degree of safety.
As of 17:00 on July 26th, the storage flow rate of Haibo Bay water conservancy hub was 2760 cubic meters per second, the discharge flow rate was 2,760 cubic meters per second, and the water level before the dam was 1071.5 meters.
At present, the floodgate dam section, the stone dam section and the tailwater slope and other hygienic buildings are normal, the monitoring data are fluctuating within the normal range, and the No. 2 floods of the Yellow River this year are passing smoothly through the Wuhai section of Inner Mongolia.
Jiangxi financial emergency release of 280 million yuan of funds to support post-disaster relief and reconstruction
On July 24, in Hukou County, Jiujiang City, Jiangxi Province, a section of the Chinese People's Liberation People's Liberation Army's 71st Army who assisted the local anti-flooding army took advantage of the standby gap to help a vegetable-growing professional cooperative in Hukou Prefecture to seize chili peppers.
Affected by the previous heavy rainfall, hundreds of acres of red chili peppers planted by the co-operative were severely affected, and the loss would be even greater if they were not picked in a timely manner.
China News Agency reporter Fukuda
China New Network Nanchang July 26 (Yuan Rujjing) Jiangxi Provincial Department of Finance on the 26th news, in accordance with Jiangxi province flood control and drought relief headquarters work deployment and requirements, the province's financial emergency issued the central and provincial disaster relief funds of 280 million yuan to provide financial protection for flood control and disaster relief work.
Since the beginning of July, the flood season and disaster situation in Jiangxi have been continuously upgraded.
The floods have led to direct economic losses of 10.07 billion yuan in the province's agricultural and rural areas, with an affected area of 13.169 million mu.
On July 17th and July 22nd, Jiangxi provincial finance successively issued central disaster relief funds of 60 million yuan and 200 million yuan.
At the same time, according to the changes in the disaster situation, from the province's special funds for emergency management, provincial disaster relief funds of 20.3 million yuan have been issued in three consecutive batches to support post-disaster relief and recovery and reconstruction in various places.
The relevant person in charge of the Jiangxi Provincial Department of Finance said on the 26th that before the arrival of the flood season, 173 million yuan of various types of disaster prevention and reduction funds have been issued to ensure the early detection, early disposal and early resolution of risks, and to provide financial support for flood relief and rescue work.
At present, the western part of the Yangtze River and Poyang Lake, China's largest freshwater lake, are slowly retreating at a high level.
At 18:00 on the 24th, the Jiangxi Provincial Defense Bureau lowered the flood control emergency response to level II; the provincial disaster relief emergency response level was adjusted from level II to level III.
The disaster assessment and post-disaster recovery and reconstruction work will continue.
Zhongxin Net Kunming, July 25 (Du Xiaotiao) reporter learned from the Yunnan Provincial Department of Finance on the 25th that recently, the finance of Yunnan Province has strengthened the fund-raising, first issuing 20 "beautiful county towns" provincial-level awards signed by the Yunnan Provincial People's Government for a total of 2 billion yuan (RMB, the same below), and each "beautiful county town" has received 100 million yuan in supplementary financial support.
On February 26, 2019, the Yunnan Provincial People's Government issued the Guiding Opinions on the Construction of "Beautiful County Towns", which made it clear that Yunnan will form a number of "beautiful county towns" with distinctive characteristics, perfect functions, beautiful ecology and livable industries throughout the province through three-year efforts.
At present, Yunnan has announced 20 “beautiful counties” such as Tengchong City, Shangri-La City, Ruili City, Weishan Yi Hui Autonomous Prefecture, Western Union Wa Autonomous County, and Pingbian Miao Autonomous County.
It is reported that the provincial award funds focus on the "beautiful county town" construction "clean, livable, characteristics" of the three goals and requirements, focusing on public and public welfare projects, to support to speed up the completion of shortcomings and weaknesses, high-standard and high-quality construction, and the "beautiful county town" as a people's heart project, people's livelihood project solid promotion.
The Yunnan Provincial Department of Finance will work with the Yunnan Provincial Development and Reform Commission to strengthen the supervision of provincial-level awards and supplementary funds, guide and urge all localities to take strong and effective measures to speed up budget implementation, transform funds into "beautiful county" construction results in a timely manner, strengthen performance operation monitoring, and improve the efficiency and effectiveness of the use of funds.
On July 26, local time, the Estonian national radio and television station reported that near the Berlin Zoo in Germany, an Estonian-licensed Mercedes drove out of the lane in the early morning of the 26th, injuring seven people.
A rescue helicopter arrived for the rescue.
The driver, who drove into the crowd, was taken into police custody.
German authorities said they had launched an investigation and there was no indication that the incident was politically or religiously motivated.
Shortly thereafter, police reported that the 24-year-old driver had lost control of the vehicle during a left-hand turn and had the possibility of speeding.
The person has been arrested and criminal proceedings have been initiated.
The chief operating officer of the Estonian Police and Border Protection Agency, Aleksandr Linde, said that the German police have contacted the Estonian police and the Border Protection Agency.
Lynde said: “I confirm what is stated in the news that there is no reason why the incident was suspected to be terrorism or motivated by political or religious motives.”
Shaanxi: solve the problem of helping after the relocation to avoid the "two-headed run" of the masses
Shaanxi: to solve the problem of help after the relocation to avoid the "two-headed run" of the masses
CCTV News: In response to the follow-up problems encountered by the migrant relocated people in integrating into the local life, Shaanxi's Kang'ang Hao County built a "neighborly house" based on local actual innovations to guide the relocation of villagers to the citizens, so as to achieve stability, rapid integration, and prosperity.
Aryao Prefecture is located in the Qinba mountain area, and nearly one-third of the local population has come out of the mountains through the relocation of immigrants.
The 39-year-old Chai Yangtze River has moved from Zhongwu Village, Yanmen Town, Aranguo County, to the Mingzhu Community of Democracy Town.
He came with the pension insurance card to the "neighborly home" in the community, and completed this year's pension insurance in less than two minutes.
At the beginning of this year, Arangao County through the construction of a "neighborly home" will be fully integrated into the management of employment, civil affairs, medical insurance and other businesses, and the relocated people can handle business at their doorstep.
In the pearl community, 305 residents entered the local community factory through the "neighborly home" recruitment information.
At present, there are more than 31 centralized resettlement sites in Aranguo County, which have achieved full coverage of community factories, providing 2,598 jobs.
The report said that the shared accommodation market has begun to pick up since March
China's shared accommodation development report 2020 (hereinafter referred to as the "report") recently released by the Sharing Economy Research Center of the National Information Center shows that due to the impact of the epidemic, in the first five months of 2020, the transaction volume of China's shared accommodation market decreased by 72.1% year-on-year.
However, the shared accommodation market has begun to pick up since March, and the market turnover, order volume and the number of reception people have gradually recovered.
The "Report" shows that the transaction volume of the shared accommodation market has dropped sharply, on the one hand, due to the sharp decline in the demand for travel under the prevention and control of the epidemic, the sharp decrease in the number of orders in the first five months, the total number of orders fell by 65% year-on-year, and the number of receptions fell by 63% year-on-year.
However, the market turnover in March, April and May increased by 78%, 199% and 35% respectively; the number of orders increased by 141%, 52% and 50% respectively; the number of recipients increased by 81%, 112% and 28% respectively.
The report pointed out that the long-term development of the shared accommodation industry, but there are still a lot of uncertainties in the near future.
In this regard, Yu Fengxia, deputy director of the Sharing Economy Research Center of the national information center, told the "Workers Daily" reporter that the development of shared accommodation needs stronger policy support, on the one hand, it is necessary to do a good job in the implementation of the policies that have been issued in the early stage, further strengthen policy publicity, focus on creating a better business environment; on the other hand, it is also necessary to further increase policy guidance and support from stimulating consumer demand, enriching the supply of tourist accommodation services, innovative service methods, and strengthening cooperation between the government and platform enterprises.
According to Reuters, the world's largest steel producer Arcelor Mittal has a new crown epidemic at a factory in the Mexican city of Lhasa Rocadenas, and 21 people have been killed so far.
According to Sologio, secretary-general of the local branch of the Mexican Union of Mining and metallurgical workers, said the dead included factory employees, contractors and suppliers.
Solorio said 21 people have been killed at the plant since April, nine of whom are union members.
Due to strict hyhygienic measures taken by the factory, it is possible for workers to become infected with the virus outside the factory.
According to the union, the plant employs more than 7,000 people.
As of July 25, the cumulative number of confirmed cases in Mexico has more than 355,000 confirmed cases and more than 40,000 deaths, and Mexico has the fourth highest number of new crown deaths in the world.
China's well-known vascular surgery center - Naval Military Medical University Shanghai Changhai Hospital vascular surgery on the 25th signed a contract with Zhongshan Hospital affiliated to Xiamen University to jointly set up a cooperation center to promote exchanges and cooperation between the two sides in the field of vascular surgery, especially in the field of amyrronectar.
According to Zhongshan Hospital affiliated to Xiamen University, after the vascular surgery of the two hospitals is officially formed into a collaborative unit, it will carry out a remote consultation, formulate a treatment plan for real-time online consultation with Changhai Hospital, select talents for further training, and jointly carry out weekly surgical technology exchanges, teaching and investigation; for complex cases, Changhai experts can be invited to the hospital for surgery according to the patient's needs, so as to realize the best medical resources in the country.
The two hospitals will also work together to carry out surgical innovation and scientific research work, aortic disease popularization and early screening work.
On the same day, the aorta special seminar sponsored by the Beijing Health Promotion Association and hosted by Zhongshan Hospital affiliated with Xiamen University was held in Xiamen on the same day.
Two well-known well-known hospitals in Shanghai and Xiamen held the signing ceremony of vascular surgery coordination center at the same time at the same time, and announced the formation of a collaborative unit to jointly improve the treatment level of vascular surgery-related diseases in the southwestern region of Fujian.
vascular surgery is the army's only vascular surgical research institute and Shanghai's only vascular physiologic disease clinical medical center, but also the first vascular surgery of the national key discipline, led the establishment of the Chinese Medical Association cavity vascular vascular vascular science professional committee, is the industry's deep accumulation of the top team.
Professor Huang Xiaojin, director of vascular surgery at Zhongshan Hospital attached to Xiamen University, was interviewed by the media.
The vascular surgery department of Zhongshan Hospital attached to Xiamen University is the first vascular surgery set up in Fujian Province, which has long been committed to the diagnosis and treatment of vascular and peripheral vascular diseases in Fujian Province, and was approved for the construction of provincial-level clinical key specialties in 2018.
In terms of the treatment of aortic diseases, in addition to the treatment of mezzanine aneurysms and aortic aneurysms, we have extensive experience in emergency ruptured aneurysms.
"Xiamen University affiliated Zhongshan Hospital vascular surgery from the history of development, the breadth, difficulty, complexity and other aspects of surgery is very outstanding in the region, so this time we set up a collaborative center, in addition to the aortic, you can also carry out medical, teaching and scientific research on the diagnosis and treatment of the lower extremity artery, carotid artery and other in-depth cooperation."
Professor Feng Rui, deputy director of vascular surgery at Changhai Hospital in Shanghai.
In 2018, Zhongshan Hospital, affiliated to Xiamen University, signed a contract with Shanghai Changhai Hospital to set up a “Li Zhaoshen Famous Medical Studio” for Digestive Internal Medicine.
Professor Huang Xiaojin, director of vascular surgery of the hospital, said in an interview with the China New Network reporter that the vascular surgery of the hospital has also officially formed a collaborative unit between the two hospitals for a long period of time, so that the cooperation and exchanges between the two sides will rise to a new level.
He said that the hospital will regularly invite Shanghai experts to Xiamen to carry out surgical technical exchanges, teaching and investigation rooms, difficult case discussions, etc. At the same time, it will further carry out remote consultation, and it is currently planned to conduct a remote consultation once a week; in addition, the department will also select personnel to study and exchange, and strengthen the cultivation and development of academic talents.
At the meeting, the reporter learned that vascular disease is the largest cause of death in China, and the aorta, as the main road of various organs of the human body, flows from the heart to the whole body and plays an important role.
The occurrence of aortic disease is often accompanied by high risk, high mortality rate and the high difficulty of treatment, the most coarse section of the aorta diameter up to 4cm, once the formation of hemangiomas, ruptured conditions, or rupture of the lining of the lining of the vascular to produce mezzanine, it will cause heavy bleeding, very dangerous.
In recent years, with the changes in people's lifestyles and the accelerated pace of life, China has become the world's largest country with high blood pressure, and aortic diseases have also increased, and now, with the development of surgical technology and industrial materials, the treatment of aortic disease has continued to develop in a minimally invasive, fast and efficient direction.
The doctor can properly "change the radiance" of the blood flow by placing a stent in the aorta from the thigh puncture, so as to avoid the impact on the aneurysm or ruptured mezzanine, to achieve a good therapeutic effect, and some surgeries even only require local anesthesia.
The academic seminar invited more than a dozen domestic experts to the scene to discuss new developments in the treatment of aortic diseases, and to carry out cutting-edge technical training in the form of conference salons and discussion of difficult cases.
At the meeting, the reporter learned that with the development of surgical technology and industrial materials, the treatment of aortic diseases continues to develop in a minimally invasive, fast and efficient direction.
The National Defense General continues to maintain the Yangtze River, Huaihe flood control level II response - Xinhua
There will be heavy rainfall from the middle and lower reaches of the Yangtze River.
