July 24 on-line iQiyi "journey" also embarked on the journey of webcast - Xinhua network
The action-adventure film "Journey", which is directed by Chen Desen and overseen by Liu Xianhua, He Rundong, Lin Chenhan and Jiang Luxia, will be launched on July 24.
This is also the second large-scale production film to choose a webcast after "Aunt Mother".
Based on the online game of the same name, "Creation" is based on online games of the same name, which tells the story of Qingyuan village boy Dong Yilong and the Chu family samurai's soul, in order to participate in the selection of the South Zhao National Army and Grand marshal and embarked on the journey, on the way to meet King Kong's younger sister, the three of them together to complete their own mission together.
This year is the 15th anniversary of the game's "jourke" IP, and the launch of the film of the same name is undoubtedly also a tribute to the classic game.
At the same time as the announcement, the film "Creation" released the "national war" version of the archive poster and the "survival" pilot trailer.
The excellent quality of the picture presents a grand picture of the nation's war in the world, depicting the profound brotherhood of the two main protagonists of Dong Yilong and Chu Soul.
"Creation" chooses an alternate era to build the background of the story.
In the fictitious Central Plains Continent, among the ten kingdoms, the South Zhao State and the Northern Yan State live next to each other.
In order to defecate against the increasingly powerful northern Yan, Nan Zhao held a competition conference, and the selection will be.
The news spread to the remote Qingyuan village, the villagers want to become the family's flag bearer, on behalf of the Qingyuan village family race, but the villagers questioned his qualifications, after some efforts, a dragon finally embarked on a journey with the samurai Chu Soul.
The film has a total investment of nearly 300 million yuan, accounting for up to 80% of the total special effects lens.
It is conceivable that the special effects have become one of the biggest highlights of the journey.
The post-effects production team is also quite motivated, and MORE VFX, the special effects team that created "Wandering Earth", uses imaginative visual art and top-notch technology to restore the "journing" world.
