In addition to the special effects team, behind-the-scenes production is also a group of accomplished characters in the industry.
Director Chen Desen has directed "October siege", "purple rain storm", producer Zheng Baorui has filmed "Killing Wolves 2", "Sun Wukong in the Journey to the West" and so on, the action scene by the Academy Award and the Golden Horse Award for the best action director Dong Wei is also the winner of the two Academy Awards.
