Earlier, Tunisia's largest parliamentary party, the Ennahda party, announced the withdrawal of its support for Fah Fahfah's government, resulting in the government's lack of sufficient support in the parliament.
The overall stability of employment and prices shows that there is a "temperature" in the economy
2020-07-26 07:01:37 Source:Economic Daily Author:Wang Sishuo Responsibility Editor:Wang Sisuo
The overall stability of employment and prices shows that there is a "temperature" in the economy
Economic Daily · China Economic Net reporter
In the first half of this year, in the face of the impact of the new crown pneumonia epidemic, China's overall efforts to promote epidemic prevention and control and economic and social development, the epidemic prevention and control situation continues to improve, the steady recovery of the economy is obvious, the employment and price performance closely related to people's livelihood is generally stable, and China's economy has handed over a record of economic operation with temperature.
In the first two months of this year, the survey unemployment rate increased.
In particular, in February, the production and business activities of many enterprises were basically in a state of shutdown, the employment demand of enterprises was reduced, recruitment was delayed or cancelled, and the unemployment rate of urban surveys increased.
With the gradual improvement of the epidemic prevention and control situation, the production and life order of the whole society has been continuously restored.
The Party Central Committee adheres to the general tone of stability and progress, further strengthens macro policy hedging, comprehensively strengthens the employment priority policy, and actively promotes efforts to stabilize and expand employment.
China's increased policy hedging and stable positions, played a combination of "relief and slow-recovery" policy, phased reduction of three social insurance unit contributions, allowing the deferred payment of social insurance premiums, the expansion of small and medium-sized small and medium-sized micro-enterprise unemployment insurance steady post return, the benefit of the job-training policy, enterprises to absorb the employment of key groups to absorb subsidies, trainee subsidies and so on.
With the implementation of various stable employment policies, the employment demand of enterprises has steadily rebounded, the employment situation has gradually improved, the unemployment rate in urban surveys has gradually declined, and in June, the survey unemployment rate was 5.7%.
Zhang Yi, director of the Population and Employment Statistics Department of the National Bureau of Statistics, said that in the second quarter, the various employment policies continued to be effective, and the labor force that withdrew due to the impact of the epidemic in the previous period returned one after another, and the urban labor force participation rate increased by about 10 percentage points in February in June, which was close to the level of the same period last year.
According to the data, the total number of urban employment increased by more than 19% in June compared with February, and most industries reached the pre-epidemic level; the average weekly working time of enterprise employees reached 46.8 hours, an increase of 6.6 hours from February and 0.1 hours higher than in January.
The price is also related to thousands of households.
In January of this year, the CPI rose by 5.4% year-on-year, hitting a new high in many years.
Entering February, although the year-on-year increase in CPI fell back slightly, it was still in the "5 range".
The year-on-year increase of CPI is at a very high level, both the factors driving consumer demand before the Spring Festival, as well as the Spring Festival wrong month and year-on-year low base factors.
However, the impact of the new crown pneumonia epidemic on prices is particularly obvious.
Affected by the prevention and control of the epidemic, in January and February all over the country, there were delays in logistics delays, untimely supply of materials, and the increase in the cost of material transportation, coupled with the hoarding of some members of the public, the price of some daily necessities increased significantly.
In order to cope with the disturbance caused by epidemic prevention and control to the price situation, the relevant departments incorporated important living materials into the scope of emergency transportation security to ensure the smooth transportation of materials.
Under the influence of a series of policy measures, the supply of vegetable melon and fruit markets has been strongly guaranteed.
In order to cope with the rapid increase in pork prices at the beginning of this year, after the central government issued a policy to ensure price stability, various regions and departments quickly implemented, the supply of pork reserves was significantly improved, pig production capacity was restored in an orderly manner, and the order of production and marketing was gradually normal.
Since the beginning of March, pork prices have continued to decline, driving the year-on-year increase in food prices falling back to 10.6% year-on-year in May; in June, pork prices rose slightly month-on-month due to factors such as the slowdown, reduced imports and the recovery of group consumer demand.
The seasonal changes in fresh vegetable prices are obvious, with an average increase of 3.4% in the first half of the year.
Affected by the relatively high base in the same period last year, fresh fruit prices continued to decline year-on-year, with an average decrease of 13.3% in the first half of the year.
The people's basic life has been effectively guaranteed, and the overall economic and social situation has remained stable and orderly.
With the gradual recovery of transportation and logistics, the supply and demand in the market have been increased, and the supply and demand situation in the market has improved.
Since the beginning of March, the CPI has declined for four consecutive months, and the year-on-year increase has also fallen from 4.3% in March to 2.5% in June, and the overall price level has stabilized.
In the second half of the year, China's prices will continue to maintain a moderate level, the overall inflationary pressure is not large, but it is still necessary to promote the restoration of production and life order under the premise of normalizing epidemic prevention and control.
Effectively respond to natural disasters such as floods and droughts in major agricultural production areas such as grain, fruits and vegetables, strengthen market supervision, and resolutely crack down on behaviors such as hoarding and raising prices to disturb market order.
