Today's rain in Beijing to "retreat" the maximum temperature dropped to 29 °C - Xinhua
Today (July 26th), the rain will return to Beijing, the maximum temperature will also drop to 29 °C, to remind the public to pay attention to carrying rain gear, pay attention to traffic safety.
Yesterday, there were more clouds in the sky in Beijing, and the maximum temperature in most parts of the urban area in the afternoon exceeded 33 °C, and the humidity increased compared with a few days ago.
With the arrival of the cold air, the rain will return to Beijing.
It is expected that during the day today, it will be cloudy, with scattered showers (accompanied by weak lightning), two or three from the south, with a maximum temperature of 29 °C; at night, there will be small to medium rain (accompanied by weak lightning), the south-to-to-north wind will be one or two, and the minimum temperature will be 23 °C.
Tomorrow, there will still be thunderstorms in Beijing, with a maximum temperature of 30 °C.
According to experts, in rainy and rainy weather for more than two days today and tomorrow, it is necessary to go out with rain utensils, pay attention to lightning protection and traffic safety, try to avoid mountain activities, and prevent geological disasters.
Heilongjiang carries out a special action to use the names of well-known hospitals to clean up and remediate
In recent years, the names of some medical institutions have become irregular and unsuitable, using the names of well-known medical institutions without being authorized in accordance with the law, which misleads the people.
After querying the credit information publicity system of national enterprises, some well-known medical institutions such as "concord" appear in the names of medical institutions that have been registered in Heilongjiang Province, and the use of well-known well-known hospitals such as "concord" to carry out their operations, disrupting the normal medical order, resulting in bad social impact.
At the same time, it will be used as an opportunity to carry out a variety of legal publicity activities to improve the sense of responsibility of market subjects, the awareness of rights protection in accordance with the law and the awareness of law-abiding management.
Through unimpeded complaint and reporting channels, a number of typical cases with bad effects have been exposed to the public, resulting in a deterrent effect.
30 e-sports projects settled, Shanghai Pudong to expand the online new economic "new track" - Xinhua
SHANGHAI, July 25 (Xinhua) -- On the 24th, 30 key e-sports projects landed in the Shanghai Pudong New Area, ranging from venues and events to enterprises, covering the entire category of e-sports industry development, which is expected to drive the regional e-sports game industry to add tens of billions of yuan in revenue.
The digital culture industry represented by e-sports games will become a new growth point of Pudong's new online economy, helping Shanghai to build a global e-sports capital.
In terms of e-sports venues, on the basis of top-level event venues such as the Meiken Cultural Center and the Oriental Sports Center, a new batch of venues such as the sports integration venue Pudong football field, the professional e-sports space Senlan e-competition hall, and the Dongchangjo space have confirmed their landing in Pudong.
Wang Haisong, general manager of Shanghai Waigaoqiao Group, told reporters that about 1500 square meters of indoor venues can accommodate 1000 people, which is currently under construction and is expected to introduce the event in March of next year.
In terms of e-sports ancillary industries, Pudong strives to improve the layout of the industrial chain.
NetEase dragon team and other world championship teams in the signing of the event to appear, the country's only game e-sports TV digital channel - the development of Pudong.
In terms of events, Pudong is actively striving for top-level international and domestic competitions to create an e-competition season.
A number of e-competitions, such as the 2020 Peace Elite International Champions Cup and the La Liga e-competition, were announced to be held in Pudong.
In terms of enterprises, Pudong focuses on promoting the landing of leading enterprises.
For example, the original information plan has successively launched dozens of game products in Pudong, NetEase Blizzard, the perfect world, fun games, etc. will also actively launch new projects and strive to form tens of billions of yuan of revenue.
According to statistics, Pudong's e-sports game industry now accounts for one-third of Shanghai.
Tencent, NetEase and a number of e-sports game leading enterprises landed in Pudong, TI9, the king glory winter competition and a number of other top events held in Pudong, Pudong is becoming the "strong heart" of Shanghai e-sports industry development.
The agglomeration of the high-quality e-sports industry in Pudong is also inseparable from the support of relevant policies.
Recently, the China Game Industry Research Institute landed in Pudong to formulate high standards for the industry.
Pudong's star vocational schools have been licensed as "Shanghai vocational education and e-sports professional pilot schools", laying the foundation for the training of talents in the e-sports industry.
The e-sports athlete registration system took the lead in landing in Pudong to further improve the professional level of e-sports players.
Huang Wei, director of the Pudong New Area Sports and Tourism Bureau, said that around the goal of building a "global e-sports capital" in Shanghai, Pudong proposed to build a "core functional area for the development of Shanghai's e-sports industry".
In the next step, Pudong will continue to focus on key events and key enterprises to accelerate development and form an industrial chain.
Using the policies of the Shanghai Pilot Free Trade Zone, in order to improve the overall development of the e-sports industry, explore and innovate, and form a replicable and scalable experience.
The first spectators of the capital theater will welcome the first audience after the epidemic tomorrow - Xinhua Net
Tomorrow at 2 p. o'clock in the afternoon, Beijing People's Art will launch the classic "The Death of a Salesman" to read aloud, ushering in a long-lost spectator at the Capital Theater.
Under the premise of â€œadhering to normal prevention and control, orderly opening up, and appointment limiting flow limit â€œBeijing will strictly implement personnel reservation flow restriction measures to ensure that the total number of spectators does not exceed 30% of the number of seats in the theater, and ensure that the audience sits at intervals and maintains a distance of more than 1 meter.
At the same time, the theater has also made sufficient preparations in terms of daily duty, cleaning and disinfection, detection and registration, garbage clean-up, site inspection, and safety management.
This event will only be open to the audience of the member card of the Friends of Arts Association, and due to the flow restriction requirements, each person will be limited to one, until it is completed.
On the day of the performance, the ticket holder must hold the original identity card and the performance ticket, wear a mask, and keep more than 1 meter at an orderly distance.
Masks should be worn throughout the performance to avoid direct conversation as much as possible.
"The Death of a Salesman" is a masterpiece by the famous screenwriter Arthur Miller, which has a wide reputation around the world since it was completed in 1949.
In the 1980s, under the mediation of Ying Ruocheng and others, Arthur Miller came to China to rehearse his work for the Beijing people's art.
The script reading is composed entirely of the young actors of Beijing people's art, and rehearsed for two weeks under the leadership of director Tang Ye, and everyone has created a small series of characters in order to deeply analyze the characters, in order to be re-examined after nearly 40 years, so that this realist drama rejuvenates the brilliance brilliance brilliance.
Today, the opening ceremony of the 2020 Hunan Red Tourism and Culture Festival and the first Red Cultural Industry Exposition was held in Shaoshan.
The Standing Committee of the Provincial Party Committee and the Propaganda Department of the Provincial Party Committee Zhang Hongsen announced the opening of the Red Tourism and Culture Festival, and Vice Governor Wu Guiying delivered a speech.
The Hunan Red Tourism Culture Festival has been successfully held for 16 sessions and is a well-known brand of red tourism in the country.
The festival will be co-sponsored by the Propaganda Department of the Provincial Party Committee, the Provincial Department of Culture and Tourism and the Xiangtan Municipal Party Committee and Municipal Government.
Wu Guiying said that it is of great significance to implement General Secretary Xi Jinping's important instructions to "use the red resources well, carry forward the red tradition, and pass on the red genes", further grasp the development of red tourism in our province, promote the recovery of the cultural and tourism market, and let the "red power" be condensed into a broad joint effort to build a rich, beautiful and happy new Hunan.
It will definitely play a more active role in promoting the red culture, inheriting the red spirit, stimulating cultural tourism consumption, and promoting the high-quality development of Hunan cultural tourism.
At the opening ceremony, the two activities of the "Rhospicion and Greeting China" Red Dance Invitational Tournament and "Re-entering the Long March Road and Crossing the Xiangrong Border" were launched at the same time.
During the festivities, there will also be activities such as the promotion and signing ceremony of the Xiangtan industrial project investment promotion and signing ceremony, the red tourism five good interpreters forum and the red education and training seminar, the red wisdom travel experience exhibition and new technology sharing, and the Hunan Mountain Song Invitational Tournament of "Xiangshui Tongyuan and Cultural Same Roots".
During the opening ceremony, leaders and guests such as Zhang Hongsen and Wu Guiying went to Xiangtan's first Red Cultural Industry Exposition and watched the live performance of "A Mao Zedong in China".
Qinghai Lake "flower sea live broadcast room": "sweet" with goods to help farmers to increase income-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-26 19:43:50 Source: China News Network Author: su yiyu Responsibility Editor: su yiyu
The picture shows Wu Na (left), the president of the Beijing Houdeli Bee Industry Co., Ltd. to introduce Qinghai bee products.
Ma Mingguang
Sino-Singapore network Qinghai Hainan July 26th topic: Qinghai lake "flower sea live broadcast room": "sweet" with goods to help farmers to increase income
Written by Hu Guilong Pan Yujie
"Summer Qinghai lake, full of golden flowers, bees flying, here high altitude, day and night temperature difference, less air pollution, strong light gave birth to the most tenacious and generous bee herd, resulting in Qinghai royal jelly high-activity, high-protein, rich in nutritional value, low-sugar and low-fat characteristics."
On the 26th, Zhang Jianxun, deputy director of the Industry and Information Administration of Hainan Tibetan Autonomous Prefecture in Qinghai Province, said.
On the same day, the "Concentric War Epidemic spring quartz" bee product live delivery event was held on the shore of Qinghai Lake, and representatives of Chinese bee products and entrepreneur representatives, bee farmers and other parties gathered to jointly promote Qinghai specialty bee products, selling a total of nearly 10,000 bottles of Qinghai Plateau royal jelly online and offline, with a total amount of nearly 3.8 million yuan.
The beehive farmers display bee products on the spot.
It is reported that the live delivery activities with the help of Beijing Houdli Bee chain chain network, fast hand, Taobao and other domestic well-known bee product retail enterprises, live broadcast, e-commerce platform, to promote the "enterprise + bee farmers + growers" exchange and cooperation, and through online and offline channels continue to issue "Qinghai Plateau spring slurry consumer vouchers", it is expected that the company's annual profit of nearly 5.28 million yuan.
In view of this, Wu Na, president of Beijing Houdeli Bee Industry Co., Ltd., believes that it is "very worthwhile": "This move can expand the popularity of Qinghai bee products, attract more consumers to understand and like non-added natural bee products, and drive bee farmers to increase their income."
At present, the company has signed a production cooperation strategic agreement with Qinghai Cloud Bee Industry Co., Ltd. and Qinghai Huabao Bee Co., Ltd. to jointly promote the rapid development of Qinghai's local bee industry.
It is a sea of canola flowers on the shores of Qinghai Lake.
In the spring of this year, due to the needs of epidemic prevention and control to set up road traffic routes in various parts of the country, beehive farmers are blocked on the road of "purchasing honey", and many bees have died due to missed the flowering period and lack of food, and the income of bee farmers has been seriously affected.
"At the end of the year, bee farmers followed the long journey of flowers, from Yunnan and Sichuan all the way to the north to move to the northwestern region, and they spent their meals and had nowhere to stay, which was very hard."
“As businesses, we have a responsibility to help them.”
Wu Na said.
Zhao Xiaochuan, executive vice president of the China Bee Products Association, introduced that bee pollination is an important link in the ecological chain and plays an irreplaceable role in protecting the diversity of plants and improving the ecological environment, which plays an irreplaceable role in protecting the diversity of plants and improving the ecological environment.
At the same time, bee pollination can increase the production and quality of crops, especially in a wide range of areas with poor management conditions, pollination is of greater significance.
The research data show that pollination can increase the yield of canola by about 15%-30%.
Zhao Xiaochuan (right), executive vice president of the China Bee Products Association, introduces Qinghai bee products.
“The economic, ecological and social benefits created by bee pollination are far greater than the value of bee’s products themselves, and the bee industry has great potential in terms of human health, crop production, revegetation and ecological protection, and little is known about.”
Zhao Xiaochuan said.
Nowadays, the number of beekeepers is less and less, in addition to the bee farmers who run all the year round, there are still many poor households with limited mobility who choose to participate in cooperatives with beehives.
"The state has financial support, we contact technical personnel to help and guide, bee farmers on the lack of understanding and judgment of the market environment, in order to open the market also requires the help and coordination of the government, enterprises and industry associations."
Zhao Xiaochuan said.
"I hope that you will pay more attention to and help the bee-keeping community in the future," Wu Na said, "our bee products are also strictly in accordance with national standards for screening and control, to ensure quality, while helping bee farmers to protect the rights and interests of consumers at the same time."
Affected by the continuous rainfall, since July 22, Chongqing Wulong District Land Township Liujing Village Zhongtai Subdistrict Subdistrict behind the edge of the soil cracking, there is a large-scale sliding deformation, completely blocking along the Cang River, the formation of the dam before the water level of 13 meters, the estimated reservoir capacity of about 550,000 cubic meters.
In order to ensure the safety of navigation, the Chongqing Maritime Department has decided to implement temporary traffic control in the waters from the stone section of the Yangtze River to Guanyin Beach.
According to Chongqing's meteorological and hydrological departments, since the 25th, the central and western and north-eastern regions of Chongqing have generally received heavy rain, heavy rain in some areas, and heavy rain in the local area.
On the evening of the 26th, the highest water level will appear, and the highest water level will be close to the alert water level.
In order to ensure the safety of navigation, the Chongqing Maritime Department has decided to implement temporary traffic control in the waters from the stone section of the Yangtze River boundary to Guanyin Beach.
After the Chongqing Municipal Defense Office and meteorological, water conservancy, hydrological and other departments and units of the emergency consultation and judgment, the Chongqing flood control and drought relief headquarters decided to issue river flood level III early warning information and launch flood control level IV emergency response.
According to the requirements of the flood control and drought relief headquarters of Chongqing Jiangbei, Sha Pingba, Tongnan, Wulong and the relevant member units of Chongqing's national defense index should pay close attention to the rain situation, especially the changes of the Yangtze River, Jialing River and Wujiang, analyze and judge in advance, issue early warning, strengthen inspections, resolutely and decisively evacuate the people in threatened areas, mobilize emergency rescue teams and materials in a timely manner, and quickly and effectively deal with the disaster (risk).
The Vietnamese Embassy in the Lao People's Democratic Republic attended the ceremony, including the Vietnamese Buddhist Association in Laos, representatives of Vientiane's provincial government and the Lao Veteran Veterinarian Association.
The ceremony was held in a solemn and solemn atmosphere, and the delegates successively fragrant the heroes and remembered their great achievements and the special solidarity relationship of the elderly.
In his speech, the Minister Counsellor Zheng said that this is an opportunity for the Vietnamese and the Laotian people to jointly remember the revolutionary heroes of the two countries and to express their gratitude to the heroes who sacrificed their lives for the independence and freedom of the two countries, and it is also a good opportunity for the two peoples to recall the two countries working side by side to fight the common enemy, strive for national independence, national reunification, jointly build the development of the country and consolidate the relations between the two countries.
Seventy-four years ago, on January 23, 1946, twenty-eight soldiers of the Old Vietnam Fighting League died heroically while attacking the Phonehe stronghold.
The victory of this attack has become a historic victory between the two countries in the early stages of the revolutionary struggle for national liberation.
Ms. Zheng stressed that the people of the two countries will always bear in the memory of the heroes who died for the cause of the national liberation struggle of the two countries, and stressed that the younger regions of the two countries will continue to carry forward the heroic and strong traditions of their predecessors, and make their due contribution to the continuous flowering of relations between the two countries and the prosperity and development of the two countries.
The Milestone Crossing!
Internazionale Unveils its 3000th Serie A match
In the early morning of the 26th Beijing time on the 26th, Serie A's traditional international Milan ushered in a landmark battle.
According to the statistics of the Italian media, the away match against Genoa is the 3,000th Serie Serie A in the history of Milan, and the Nerazzurri is also the first team to unlock this milestone.
Since the league changes in 1929, Inter are the only team that has never been absent from Serie A, and it is also the only team that has never been relegated.
According to Italian media reports, the match between Inter Milan and Genoa is the 3,000th game in the history of the Blue and Black Army team.
In this milestone battle, Inter defeated Genoa with three goals.
Lukaku started twice, and Sanchez, who came from the bench, also contributed a goal.
From the very beginning, the game went into the rhythm of Internazionale, and the attack finally transformed into a goal in the 34th minute.
Billagi passed on the left, Lukaku's middle-of-the-envelated header broke the goal.
In the 82nd minute, Internazional Madrid did the same way, Moses on the right side of the pass, Sánche's mid-way bag pushed his hand; before the end, Lukaku completed the opening two times, the counter-attack in Brozovic sent a long-distance straight stop, Lukaku broke into the penalty area after shoving the empty goal score, the score was fixed at 3:0.
Internazionale's 3-0 victory over Genoa, the points over Atalanta rose to No. 2, behind the leader Juventus by 4 points in the case of more than one match, and still retain the hope of winning the championship.
So far, in these 3,000 Serie A games spanning nearly 90 years, Inter have won 1,489 of them, tied 834 games, and lost 677, with a winning rate of 49.6%.
Among them, the team scored a total of 5,038 goals and conceded a total of 1,608 goals.
The Nerazzurri have won the league 18 times and have never been relegated.
