The old face of the spy drama Liu Yunlong played a stauncing male protagonist - Xinhua.com
Produced by Liu Yunlong and directed by Yin Fei, Liu Yunlong, Suqing, Leung Guanhua, Li Liqun and other large-scale spy war drama "Wonder" landed in Guangdong Satellite TV's "Vibrant Theater" at 7:30 p.m. on July 16.
The series tells the story of Tang Fei (Liu Yunlong), a CCP underground party member lurking in the Japanese fake police station, uniting with Soviet agents to assassinate the leader of the Japanese agent and crush the shocking conspiracy of the Japanese army.
Based on historical facts, the material is taken from the Soviet military archives that have been sealed for many years.
During the defense war in Moscow, the elite of the Soviet Red Army in the Far East rushed to the aid, at this time, the Japanese Kwantung Army "northern army" believes that there is an opportunity to take advantage and intends to send troops.
In order to defuse the danger of the enemy's belly, the CCP and the Communist Party of the Soviet Union's intelligence personnel jointly implemented the "Mudan Ula" plan.
According to this historical background, the well-known screenwriter Deng Yuan has been polished several times, so that the plot twists and turns.
Liu Yunlong also served as a producer and lead actor in "Worship" this time.
In the play, he plays Tang Fei, who is the head of the criminal section of the Linhe police department, a stammering policeman who is quite happy or even a little timid, and whose real identity is an underground member of the Communist Party of China.
Cai Meng, the heroine who staged an antagonism, was the head of the Linhe Security Bureau, which was appreciated by the Japanese boss Fukuhara, and there was a delicate relationship between him and Tang Fei, who was also friends and ambiguous.
In recent years, Su Qing has tried a lot of different types of characters, from "those years we are very young" from Lu Ruwen in the "Yellow Jubilee Raiders", have left a deep impression on the audience, the acting has been recognized.
The Suqing and Liu Yunlong are partners for the first time, stammering sheriff's set-up with femininity female police officers, which is quite interesting and innovative.
In addition to the two protagonists, there are Liang Guanhua, Li Liqun, Qian Bo, Lei Han, Shen Junyi and many other powerful actors to join, and the old play is also one of the highlights of the play.
It is understood that the "opportunity" production is also very good, the crew across Jiangsu, Zhejiang, Liaoning three provinces nearly 2000 kilometers of shooting.
In order to restore the strange urban landscape in the north-eastern Japanese period, the costume art props group rushed to work day and night, carefully polishing every detail of the scene construction and props, so that the scene in the play was exquisite and rich in historical quality.
Floods in Yemen's two western governorates leave 16 dead
Xinhua News Agency, Kuwait City, July 26 (Reporter Nie Yunpeng) Sana: According to Yemen's local media reported on the 26th, Yemen's western Hodeidah and Haji provinces were hit by heavy rainfall, the past 48 hours of flooding has caused at least 16 deaths.
Flooding caused by rainfall in Hodeidah province killed 13 people and killed three in neighboring Hajj province.
In addition, dozens of houses were destroyed by the floods in the north of Hodeidah and the southern region of Hajj, and some roads and farmland were damaged to varying degrees.
Years of military conflict have caused Yemen’s health system to nearly collapse.
According to statistics from the United Nations Office for the Coordination of Humanitarian Affairs, the number of people infected with cholera in Yemen has exceeded 1 million since 2017, and the death toll has exceeded 2,000.
Yemen's health-care facilities are concerned that the ongoing floods will cause the cholera epidemic to re-emergence.
"Jedi attack" release 鏖战 boxing dream of life - Xinhua.com
The online film "Jedi Attack", starring Liao William, Dongyu, Yang Xinzhen, Wang Yibo and others, was officially released in iQiyi.
The film tells the story of Descendant Winas returning to the fist stage and fighting for dignity, showing a blood-thirsty journey of unbridled dreams.
Taking Thailand as the driving force for the main plot, the film "Taipei" is used as the starting point for the pursuit of dreams of the fallen boxing king Venus, and the whole story is carried out under the adaptation of traditional Chinese cultural values, whether it is the determination of Venus to set a fake boxing for the master in the early stage, or the efforts to re-energize the fight for dignity with the support of friends and lovers in the later period, which shows the pursuit and great love of men's families and dreams in traditional Chinese culture.
Combined with the classic Hollywood sports film story model and the strong combination of the professional teams of China and Thailand, "Jedi Attack" will not only show an international effect, but will also impress different types of audiences.
At the same time, "Jedi attack" shows a large number of Muay Thai fight and training plot, the scene is intense and blood.
In the film, Zhang Xiaoliang, a game designer played by Dongyu, helps Venus, played by Liao William, to return to the fist stage and take the laurel, combining the new and interesting high-tech with the hot-blooded competitive competition, and also showing the brotherhood of Zhang Xiaoliang and Venus who seems to be "Different".
In addition, the long-flowing love between Venus and the crystal is also very touching, the crystal for Venus has been the silent support of Venus and Venus's firm commitment to the crystalline, have let the audience to see the "iron man's tenderness on Venus", but also added a lot of affection to the fallen boxing champion.
