Greenland opens a new round of mixed reform Shanghai state-owned enterprises to transfer 17.5% of the shares - economic observation network-professional financial news website
On July 26, Greenfield Holdings (600606.SH) issued an indicative announcement on the proposal of state-owned shareholders to transfer some of the company's shares and the resumption through the public solicitation of transferees.
The content of the announcement shows that in order to further deepen the reform of state-owned state-owned enterprises, optimize the structural adjustment of the state-owned enterprise layout and improve the shareholding structure of green space, Shanghai Real Estate (Group) Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Shanghai Real Estate") and Shanghai City Investment (Group) Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to as "Shanghai City Investment") intends to transfer some of the company's shares held through an agreement through public solicitation of the transferee.
The price of the transferred shares is not lower than the higher of the following: the arithmetic average of the daily weighted average price for the first 30 trading days of the indicative announcement date (July 27, 2020); and the company's audited net asset value per share for the most recent fiscal year.
At present, there is still inconclusive about the new strategic investors of green space, and according to the announcement information, it is estimated that the new strategic investors need to pay about 14 billion yuan to win 17.5% of the shares transferred in the mixed reform of Greenland.
It is worth noting that after the completion of the share transfer, it is expected that there will still be no controlling shareholders and actual controllers, but the control structure may change greatly.
Since its establishment, Greenland Holdings has carried out a number of institutional reforms: from 1992 to 1997, it operated in accordance with market-oriented rules under the pure state-owned system; from 1997 to 2013, it established and continuously improved the joint-stock system of state-owned holdings and employee holdings; from 2013 to 2015, it introduced strategic investors to form a mixed ownership system of cross-shareholding and mutual integration of state-owned and non-public capital.
Greenland's current mixed-reform program is similar to Gree, and in December 2019, Gaoli Capital led Zhuhai Mingjun to take over 15% of Gree Electric Appliances (000651.SZ) with 41.662 billion yuan, Gree Group retired as a minority shareholder, and after the completion of the mixed reform, Gree Electric implemented modern enterprise management methods such as executive incentive plan and no actual controller structure.
Zhang Yuliang, chairman and chairman and president of Greenland Real Estate and Shanghai City Investment are all state-of-the-art-owned enterprise groups wholly owned by the Shanghai Municipal SASAC, saying that Greenland's move is an important measure in Shanghai to promote the comprehensive reform of state-owned state-owned state-owned enterprises in accordance with the requirements of the Party Central Committee and accelerate the reform of state-owned state-owned enterprises in a new stage, which fully shows the new ideas of reform in accordance with local conditions and tailoring.
Inter-provincial tour to resume the country's first inter-provincial EMU tourist line-Xinhua
HANGZHOU, July 25 (Reporter Li Ping) At 12:20 on July 25th, more than 200 Shanghai tourists who took the D771 train successfully arrived in Lanxi City, Zhejiang Province, which was also the first inter-provincial EMU tourist train since the Ministry of Culture and Tourism resumed inter-provincial (autonomous regions and cities) on July 14.
It is located in the central and western city of Lanxi City in central and western Zhejiang, the scenery is beautiful, the territory has many attractions such as Zhuge gossip village, underground long river, Shiyan ancient village and many other scenic spots, in the two days and one-night trip, more than 200 Shanghai tourists will enjoy these attractions one by one.
Li Li, deputy general manager of Shanghai Railway International Tourism (Group) Co., Ltd., said that according to the latest policy, the company focused on inter-provincial tourism needs, communicated with Lanxi City for the first time, and carefully launched the "Shanghai to Lanxi" and "Summer Appreciation Two-Day Tour" products, which were sold out in less than a week.
Aunt Sun, who is from Shanghai, has not gone out this year because of the epidemic.
"At home for a long time, as soon as I saw a team tour, I immediately shared the news with my friends to sign up, I had never come to Lanxi before, and I was very much looking forward to this trip."
It is understood that in September of last year, Lanxi City signed a strategic cooperation agreement with Shanghai Railway International Tourism (Group) Co., Ltd. for the "high-speed rail · Youlanxi" project, and plans to open 12 high-speed rail tourism trains to Lanxi within one year from Jiangsu, Zhejiang and Shanghai.
