"Chinese doctor" prepared to pay tribute to the anti-epidemic hero - Xinhua
Recently, with the respect of Chinese filmmakers to fight the heroes of the epidemic, the chairman of the Bona Film Industry Group and the director Liu Weiqiang (pictured left) held a discussion and exchange on the production of the anti-epidemic-themed film "Chinese doctor" in Guangzhou.
Bona Pictures hopes to pay homage to all the medical and anti-epidemic workers who are fighting on the front line of epidemic prevention and control through "Chinese Doctors"!
In 2021, the film will be screened nationwide as a ceremony to celebrate the 100th anniversary of the founding of the Communist Party of China.
At present, under the arrangement and deployment of the Central Propaganda Department and the National Film Bureau, the Guangdong Provincial Film Bureau and the Hubei Provincial Film Bureau have organized the film "China's captain" with the support of the Guangdong Provincial Film Bureau and the Hubei Provincial Film Bureau to prepare the film "Chinese Doctor", which is a film that is reflected in the strong leadership of the Party Central Committee to unite and fight against the new crown pneumonia epidemic.
The film will focus on the first line of anti-epidemic in Wuhan, which will take Wuhan medical staff and medical teams in various provinces and cities as the background, from the perspective of human nature, the use of a unique narrative, as well as a very impactful camera language to show the touching story of Chinese medical staff full of dedication and sacrifice in the first line of anti-epidemic.
It is understood that for the first time on the day of Wuhan's unsealing, the company will overcome a lot of difficulties, sent a filming team deep into the front line of the epidemic, face-to-face with hundreds of health care workers to communicate and collect information, and has now interviewed academician Zhong Nanshan himself, Guangzhou rushed to the first person in support of Wuhan, the first person in charge of Guangdong, as well as Wuhan Jinyintan Hospital, Wuhan Union Hospital, Zhongnan Hospital, Wuhan Central Hospital and other anti-epide.
Academician Zhong Nanshan also put forward expectations and hopes for the shooting of the film at the symposium: "I am looking forward, I hope that you should not only visit some of the experts who show more appearances, but also pay more interviews to the medical personnel who are working hard in the front line, they are the majority."
He said that he had seen "me and my motherland" and "Chinese captain" before, and thought it would be a good way to tell the story of the big pattern from the perspective of ordinary people.
“There are still some misunderstandings about China from foreign friends.”
When talking about the dissemination of the film, academician Zhong Nanshan said that at present, some people in foreign countries like to label the virus as politicized, and he hopes that the film can impress the audience from the perspective of human nature: "In addition to being screened in China, it is best to be screened in foreign countries.
Academician Zhong Nanshan also fondly recalled the 1980's film "people to the middle age", "so many years have passed, after the reform and opening-up of the film is the most impressive "people to the middle age", when my foreign doctors and friends are watching and crying, if "Chinese doctor" can play such a role, it will be remarkable."
Academician Zhong Nanshan said that it will be very successful if "Chinese doctor" can arouse the resonance of foreign audiences.
During the discussion and exchange, academician Zhong Nanshan also shared opinions and suggestions on the prevention and control of the current international epidemic, "I believe that people will always be wiser than the virus."
Academician Zhong Nanshan said that although the virus is difficult to predict, but from the primitive society so far, human beings have been through thousands of dangers, now modern society has developed medical science and technology and social management measures, coupled with the world's medical staff, and even ordinary people have a basic understanding of the scientific response to the new crown pneumonia epidemic, people will no longer be as passive as in the past, one is to study how to strengthen cooperation in the world, the second is to pay attention to the soothing of people's hearts.
(Reporter Wang Jinyue)
