In the first half of telecommunication network fraud crime increased by 70%, the summary characteristics of the highest inspection
In the first half of this year, the national procuratorial organs prosecuted a total of 58,101 fraud crimes, an increase of 35% year-on-year.
In particular, among the crimes of obstructing the prevention and control of the epidemic, the number of fraud crimes prosecuted by the procuratorial organs accounted for 43.4% of the total number of crimes for the prevention and control of the epidemic.
The Supreme People's Procuratorate has carried out targeted guidance, and there have been a total of a total of 10 typical cases related to the prevention and control of the epidemic.
Judging from the handling of cases by procuratorial organs in the first half of the year, there are a large number of names involved in fraud, from national macroeconomic policies to people's food, clothing and housing, including epidemic fraud, "medical trust" fraud, "health care products" fraud, "enrolment intermediary" fraud, "routine loan" fraud, defrauding state subsidy fraud, national asset unfreezing fraud, etc.
In particular, some telecommunications network fraud breaks through the limitations of national borders, regions and personnel, and has characteristics such as stakeholders, cross-border, long-distance, and e-payments, which are not specific to the affected groups.
For example, some have set up special companies to rent high-end office buildings, set up a number of departments or positions, use legitimate online platforms to publicize and recruit, train and evaluate recruiters, adopt enterprise operation mode management, wear a "legitimate cloak", which is more confusing.
Punish and prevent crimes in accordance with the law and issue early warnings to the public and relevant departments in a timely manner is the responsibility of the procuratorial organs.
In judicial cases, the procuratorial organs earnestly perform their responsibilities, not only insisting on maintaining a high-pressure situation for fraudulent crimes, but also detailing various law enforcement measures in a targeted manner, and promoting social governance such as issuing procuratorial recommendations.
The procuratorial organs strictly regard the facts, evidence, procedures, and the application of the law on the basis of the facts of the arrest and prosecution of fraud cases, based on the facts and on the basis of the law.
Especially for telecommunications network fraud crimes, pay attention to the central role of electronic data in the identification of facts, and strive to build a chain of evidence between electronic data, verbal evidence and documentary evidence.
For example, the Yinzhou District Procuratorate of Ningbo City, Zhejiang Province should deal with an epidemic-related fraud case, the procuratorial organ intervened in advance in the first time, from the occurrence of the case to the completion, only 5 days, reflecting the attitude and determination to quickly and strictly handle and maintain the overall stability of the society.
In the process of reviewing arrests and censoring prosecutions, we should pay attention to the prosecution of missed criminals in the case, correct 733 missed arrests by the public security organs, and correct the omission of public security organs to review and prosecute 1,113 co-perspectives.
In the first half of the year, the national procuratorial organs issued 298 procuratorial recommendations for fraud crimes to promote joint efforts to prevent fraudulent crimes and promote deep-seated governance.
For example, in response to loopholes in the supervision of telecommunications networks such as telecommunications enterprises, banks and intermediary organizations found in the handling of the case, the Guangzhou Municipal Procuratorate of Guangdong Province and the Procuratorate of Dongguan City promptly put forward procuratorial recommendations, urging the relevant units to strengthen supervision, improve the mechanism, and promote the construction of a long-lasting system.
The fourth is to make every effort to do a good job of retrieving losses.
The procuratorial organs of various localities have grasped important links such as intervening in the investigation to guide the collection of evidence, reviewing and prosecuting, urging the investigative organs to actively recover stolen funds, cooperating with the relevant departments to do a good job in the recovery of stolen funds, and striving to minimize the economic losses caused by fraud crimes to the people.
For example, the Beijing Municipal Prosecutor's Procuratorate handled a certain set of road loan cases, the case involves 22 houses waiting to be sealed, in the case that the real estate may be disposed of in the case of other pre-disposal cases, the "suspensive execution letter", timely service to the relevant court, it is recommended that the previous seizure court suspend the execution of the real estate involved, and make the best efforts to recover the property and recover the losses of the victims.
The prosecutor reminded everyone to have a high degree of vigilance against fraud crimes, don't look forward to "falling pies in the sky", and don't think that it's cheap to be credulous and keep your own "money bag."
Weining County, Guizhou Province, the town: the dwarf apple tree widened the way out of poverty
2020-07-26 11:42:58 Source:China Economic Net Author:Zhu Yanjing Responsibility Editor: Zhu Yanjing
Economic Daily-China Economic Net reporter walked into Zhonghai Village, Yuna Town, Weining County, Guizhou Province.
Against the scorching sun, the villager Li Yuanzhong hoeed grass in the base, and although his face was red, his mouth hummed from time to time a few small songs.
Weining County, where the town is located, due to its low latitude and high altitude, sufficient light, large temperature difference between day and night, the sugar content of the apples produced is high and the taste is good, it has a certain popularity in the surrounding areas, but it has also not been able to sell a good price because of its small size and many spots, and it has not been able to form an industrial scale.
It used to be a poor township in the spring and autumn of Baogu, and the incidence of local poverty was as high as 25.8% 10 years ago.
It is urgent to change the traditional planting habits, adjust the industrial structure, and increase the income of farmers.
Chen Chao, secretary of the party committee of the town, and after many visits, believed that industrial development can no longer take the old road.
To this end, the town has introduced leading enterprises to grow apples in a modern way.
Hou Jianwen, deputy general manager of Weining Beyond Agriculture Co.
At the beginning, the village mobilized Li Yuanzhong to transfer the land out to plant apple trees, and Li Yuanzhong and his wife muttered in their hearts: "They planted apples for so many years, and they didn't see anyone in the village who planted apples to make a fortune."
“All grown apples are dwarfed apples that don’t make the apple tree grow too high.”
What Li Yuanzhong did not expect was that the apple planting adopted a new method, the irrigation water pipe was laid under each apple tree, the water and the fertilizer were poured on the roots of the tree, and when the fruit was harvested in the autumn, the tractor drove directly into the orchard, and the fruit could be picked while standing.
At present, the apple base has gradually entered a fruitful period, and the market, as envisioned by Hou Jianwen, Apple does not worry about selling, and is loved by consumers in Beijing, Shanghai, Guangzhou and other cities.
The growing apple industry has made Li Yuanzhong's life have a new change, although it is still planting land, but there is a new source of income.
Li Yuanzhong family has more than 9 acres of land transferred to the apple base, every year, in addition to the guaranteed land transfer fee, there are profits after the fruit, the husband and wife usually work in the base, "a person can get 80 yuan a day, there is work all the year round."
Li Yuanzhong told reporters that last year's profit dividend of more than 2,800 yuan, coupled with the land transfer fee and the couple's work income, the family's income of more than 80,000 yuan, "eating and wearing, the well-off days have been lived."
At present, the annual output value of 1 acre of apples is more than 15,000 yuan, which is about 10 times that of planting corn."
Chen Chao told reporters that the whole town is currently planting 20,000 acres of apples, there are 6000 mu in Zhonghai Village alone, covering 4,056 households and 17,200 people, of which it covers 656 poor households and 2,952 people, and the annual salary is more than 6 million yuan, which truly realizes that the base is built on the doorstep and does not have to go outside.
Li Yuanzhong began to realize his "wish".
In the Lunar New Year this year, Li Yuanzhong bought an off-road vehicle, and now drives a car to and from work every day, "there are more than a dozen acres of land at home, waiting for the next apple base to expand the scale, all transferred to them, the income is even more."
Economic Daily-China Economic Net reporter Wu Bingze 牛瑾 Wang Xinwei
Membrane separation technology to help solve the "greenhouse effect"
Membrane separation technology helps to solve the "greenhouse effect"
Schematic diagram of new hybrid matrix film preparation technology
A few days ago, the atmospheric environment and bio-energy team of Tianjin University has made significant progress in "membrane segregation to catch carbon dioxide" and successfully developed a new hybrid matrix membrane preparation technology to greatly improve the carbon dioxide capture performance of film materials.
The relevant results have been published as a cover article in the international journal Greenhouse Gases: Science and Technology.
The "greenhouse effect" is a major environmental problem plaguing human development, and carbon dioxide emissions are responsible for the "greenhouse effect".
How to efficiently capture and take advantage of carbon dioxide emitted by humans is the focus of scientists.
"membrane separation method" is an emerging carbon dioxide capture technology, which isolates carbon dioxide gas with the help of membrane materials and has the characteristics of high efficiency, energy saving and simple operation.
How to make the membrane material "breath deeply" and improve the efficiency of gas separation is a bottleneck to capture carbon dioxide by the membrane separation method.
The scientific research team of Tianjin University has innovated ideas and explored the impact of different solvents on the separation properties of membrane gases through repeated experiments.
The experimental results show that with N-methylpyrrolidone as the preparation of solvents, the carbon nanotubes in the generated membrane material are more evenly distributed and "more permeable", which effectively improves the gas separation efficiency and rate of membrane materials.
Using this new technology to prepare the hybrid matrix film, the carbon dioxide separation performance is close to the current theoretical separation limit of such membrane materials.
"The new technology provides a new way to capture carbon dioxide by membrane separation."
"We hope that this technology can provide strong support for future coal-fired power plants and chemical companies to deal with flue gas and play a significant role in controlling greenhouse gas emissions."
Before volunteering to fill in, you must first understand what is the professional grade difference-Zhongxin.com
2020-07-27 02:22:36 Source:Chongqing Morning News Author:Yuxiao Responsibility Editor:Yuxiao
Find out what is a difference in the professional level before you volunteer.
Every year to fill in the college entrance examination volunteers, there are students or parents because they do not understand the nouns involved in the voluntary report, and thus affect the volunteers to fill in.
This year, Beijing Jiaotong University, Beijing University of Science and Technology, Beijing University of Posts and Telecommunications, Beijing Forestry University and Beijing University of Chemical Technology jointly issued a 2020 admissions policy to cancel the professional grade difference.
What do you mean by a professional grade and what is the significance in voluntary reporting?
There are three types of professional distribution rules.
The experts reminded that before filling out the volunteer, we must thoroughly read the school's admissions regulations and understand the admission rules of colleges and universities, including the proportion of transfers and professional distribution rules.
The professional allocation rules refer to the three main professional priorities for professional admission after the adjustment of the university.
The specific method used by the university will be clearly defined in the enrollment regulations.
However, there are also some colleges and universities whose admission principle is the overall priority, and there is no grade difference between the majors.
In other words, the candidates in the scope of admission in accordance with the total score, when the score does not reach the first professional voluntary admission score line, it depends on whether it has reached the second professional voluntary admission score line, and so on until the admission to the last professional volunteer, there is no grade difference between professional volunteers.
The so-called "Professional grade difference" is that when the college arranges the candidate's major, according to one or a few points published in the admissions regulations to determine the admission of different professional voluntary candidates, this score value is "professional grade difference".
That is, the difference between the scores of the first professional volunteers and the non-first professional volunteers admitted to the candidates, and the difference between the volunteer grades of each profession, such as 3 points, 2 points, 1 minute and so on.
For example.
Assume that the student Xiaoming applied to A colleges and universities with 560 points, its professional volunteers were: computers, international trade, automation, mechanical engineering, e-commerce, the professional admission of A colleges and universities to implement the professional grade difference method, the grade difference is divided into 2 points, 1 minute, 1 minute, 0 points.
In terms of professional distribution, if Xiaoming's first professional volunteer meets the professional admission requirements and there is a balance of the professional plan, then Xiaoming is admitted to the "computer" major; if the computer is not admitted, his score will be subtracted by 2 points, according to the results of 558 points with the first professional volunteer to apply for "international trade", to determine whether it meets the professional admission conditions; if it is still unable to meet, the score will no longer be able to subtract the third professional voluntary "automation" admission.
Different university professional level settings are different
With the popularization of parallel volunteers, many colleges and universities have now canceled the professional grade difference, but this year there are still some colleges and universities still retain this method, from the "admission regulations" announced by the schools, this year, there are more than 20 major universities to set the professional level difference.
For example, Sichuan Agricultural University, Shandong University of Science and Technology, Heilongjiang University of Traditional Chinese Medicine, Jiangsu University of Science and Technology, Jiangxi Normal University, Chengdu School of Medicine, Northeast Electric Power University, Shimei University, Nanjing Medical University, Nanjing Institute of Technology, Ningxia University, Shandong Institute of Technology, China Civil Aviation Flight College, etc.
In these colleges and universities, the professional level of each university is different.
Some colleges and universities in each major have grade difference, such as Ningxia University, the file has been sent to the school's test takers, according to the candidate to fill in the order of professional volunteers in order to reduce by 1 point in order of admission.
And some universities have set different professional grade differences between different majors.
For example, the total value of professional volunteer grade difference is 4 points, that is, the difference between professional volunteers and other professional volunteers is 3 points, there is no grade difference between other professional volunteers, which is regarded as a parallel volunteer, and the difference between other professional volunteers is 1.
When filling out the voluntary report, candidates and parents must carefully read the admission policy of the reported school, to see if there is a difference in the professional grade, the form of grade difference is how, while fully considering the score at the same time, but also a reasonable analysis of the selected schools and majors, if the institution in the admissions charter clearly adopts the grade difference method for admission, candidates in the choice of major, pay attention to the gradient between the majors, improve the admission rate.
Chongqing Morning News · Upstream Journalist Lin Qi
This year’s first Atlantic hurricane made landfall in Texas, which was hit hard by the epidemic.
The U.S. National Hurricane Center announced this morning that Hurricane Hanna had a speed of 145 kilometers per hour and was expected to cause heavy rainfall in southern Texas and north-eastern Mexico until next Monday, which in turn caused rapid flooding.
At present, with the gradual promotion of land, the custom has been weakened, although there are power outages in some areas, but there are no casualty statistical reports for the time being.
A number of local officials in Texas are preparing for a tornadoes that are likely to emerge in the coastal zone.
President Donald Trump said on Twitter that his office was closely monitoring the dynamics of Hurricanes Hanna and Hurricane Douglas in Hawaii, and called on the public to listen to the local government's emergency management information to protect families and property.
At the same time, the new crown epidemic in Texas is also worsening sharply, and the number of infected people continues to soar, with more than 390,000 confirmed infections and more than 5,000 deaths.
When the hurricane strikes, the government will face the dual problem of sheltering the homeless, while preventing the epidemic from worsening again.
For the first time to set up a special committee, the collective signing of the "long contract" The 3rd CIIE Exhibitor Alliance to build a "CIIE bond" - Xinhua
The scene of the first meeting of the Exhibitor Alliance of the 3rd CIIE was filmed in Shanghai on July 26.
Xinhua News Agency, Shanghai, July 26 (Reporter Zhou Rui) On the 26th, the 3rd Import Expo Exhibitor Alliance set up a professional committee here for the first time, the first batch of special committees including public health epidemic prevention committee and dairy special committee, 35 member companies have also signed a three-year long-term exhibition cooperation memorandum.
At the first meeting of the 3rd CIIE Exhibitor Alliance held here on the 26th, a number of member companies such as South Korean Hyundai, Dow Chemistry in the United States, Shiseido in the United States, New Zealand New Zealand, Siemens in Germany, Michelin in France and AstraZeneca in the United Kingdom signed a three-year long-term exhibition cooperation memorandum, and the revised and improved articles of association were also announced for the first time.
On July 26, the establishment ceremony of the Dairy Professional Committee was filmed in Shanghai.
In accordance with the latest articles of association, it will introduce the rotation mechanism of the leading unit to strengthen the function of the special committee.
The specific committee will make suggestions for the analysis of the development trend of the industry and promote the sustainable development of the industry.
At the same time, integrate the resources of the entire industrial chain of the industry, with large and small, drive related enterprises to participate in the exhibition, and build the Expo into a highland for industry enterprises.
For the first time, the establishment of a special public health epidemic prevention committee is particularly important for the current fight against the new crown pneumonia epidemic.
As the vice-chairman unit of the Public Health Epidemic Special Committee of the 3rd CIIE, Qiu Jianping, general manager of Abbott's rapid diagnostic business in Greater China, said that in the next step, Abbott will work with more industry partners to explore new solutions and cooperation models to help China and the world fight against the new crown pneumonia epidemic.
On July 26, the establishment ceremony of the Public Health Epidemic Preparedness Professional Committee was filmed in Shanghai.
It is reported that for the first time, a public health epidemic prevention zone has been set up for the third Expo, and nearly 50 global enterprises have registered to participate in the exhibition, with an exhibition area of more than 10,000 square meters.
During the first CIIE in 2018, CIIE Exhibitor Alliance was set up by exhibitors at its own initiative, aiming to become a platform for exchanges and cooperation of high-quality exhibitors, a platform for connecting information and resource-sharing among exhibitors, and a think-tank platform to promote economic and trade business exchanges and development between China and other countries (regions).
Up to now, 142 enterprises have joined the Exhibitor Alliance, covering 23 countries and regions around the world.
Three-year-old Belgian girl dies of new coronavirus infection
Belgium's health department said on the 24th that a three-year-year-old girl died of the new coronavirus infection, which is the country's youngest new coronavirus death.
Belgian health department spokesman Budven Catry said that the girl had had other serious diseases before she was infected with the new coronavirus; in addition to the girl, an 18-year-old had recently died of the new coronavirus infection.
Patry said 85 per cent of new coronavirus diagnoses in Belgium last week were under the age of 60.
He reminded people who are in good health and younger should not be taken lightly.
"Although it is rare for young people to die from the new coronavirus infection, no one is now immune."
The number of new coronavirus cases in Belgium last week increased by 89% compared to the previous week, with an average of 2.9 deaths per day, up from an average of 1.7 per day in the previous week.
At the peak of the epidemic in Europe, the proportion of people infected with the new coronavirus in the Belgian population is among the best in Europe.
There are more than 11 million people in Belgium.
According to the latest data, a total of 64,847 people in Belgium have been infected with the new coronavirus.
Katri warned earlier this week that people must take action before snowballing, eventually creating an “avalanche.”
In order to curb the rebound of the epidemic, Belgian Prime Minister Sophie Vermes announced on the 23rd that the relevant regulations on people wearing masks in public places will be more stringent, and the plan to further lift the restrictive measures in August will also be suspended.
(Guo Qian) [Xinhua News Agency micro-enactment]
1 new case of asymptomatic infection imported from abroad in Jiangsu
According to the official micro-blog news of the Jiangsu Provincial Health and Health Commission, there were no new confirmed cases in Jiangsu at 0-24 hours on July 25.
As of 24:00 on July 25, a total of 655 confirmed cases have been reported in the province (of which 24 cases have been imported from abroad), with the exception of one confirmed confirmed case imported from abroad for isolation and treatment at a designated hospital.
On the same day, one new case of asymptomatic infection was imported from abroad.
As of 24:00 on July 25, there were 4 cases of asymptomatic infected people who were under centralized isolation and medical management, which were imported from abroad.
At present, 14,084 close contacts of confirmed cases and asymptomatic infected people have been traced in the province, 13,943 people have been relieved of medical observation, and 141 people are undergoing medical observation.
[Edited by: Chen Haifeng]
HONG KONG, July 25 (Xinhua) -- Qiu Tenghua, Secretary for Commerce and Economic Development of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region Government, said on the 25th that all APEC member economies should act together to jointly fight the epidemic and promote economic recovery, and should avoid the establishment of unnecessary trade barriers in accordance with the rights and obligations established by the World Trade Organization.
Qiu Tenghua made the above statement when he participated in the video conference of trade ministers to fight against the new crown pneumonia epidemic held by the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) on the 25th.
At the meeting, the participating ministers exchanged views on APEC's response to the impact of the new crown pneumonia epidemic, as well as the substantive solutions that can be taken to promote economic recovery in the region.
Qiu said that the public health and economic crisis triggered by the epidemic has had an unprecedented and far-reaching impact on society and economy.
"We are in a double battle, and we must defeat the epidemic before we can save the economy."
We want to be clear, the virus is our common enemy, cooperation can only achieve victory, but on the contrary, it will only fail.”
Qiu Tenghua said that the series of trade restrictions caused by the new crown pneumonia epidemic will not help to control the epidemic.
Trade was a key solution to the current problem and should not be seen as a problem.
Denouncing all discriminatory and divisive policy measures, he urged all economies to keep their borders open at this critical time, keep their supply chains running smoothly, and refrain from establishing trade barriers or adopting irrational trade policies.
Florida confirms 414,000 new cases of new coronavirus, the second most serious state of the U.S. epidemic
According to a comprehensive report on July 26, the Johns Hopkins University website in the United States shows that as of about 8:34 Beijing time on the 26th, there were more than 414,000 new crown confirmed cases in the United States in Florida, surpassing New York's 411,000, becoming the second "epidemic area" in the United States after California.
The Florida Department of Health said on the 25th that Florida reported 124 deaths on the 24th.
This is the tenth daily death toll in Florida since the start of the new coronavirus.
It is reported that the total number of cases in Miami-Dade County, the worst outbreak in Florida, has more than 100,000 cases.
There are currently 8,974 new coronavirus hospitalizations in Florida, including 1,874 in Miami-Dade.
Since July 4, the number of new crown hospitalizations in the state has increased by 79%.
Since the first U.S. U.S. state re-opened on April 24, 91,000 lives have been taken by the new crown.
According to data provided by Johns Hopkins University, the total number of confirmed diagnoses reported in the United States has reached 4.176 million, and at least 146,000 people have died.
The people of Chengdu gathered together to observe the U.S. Consulate, and the police prevented people from "looking too happy."
In response to the U.S. closure of the U.S. Consulate General in Houston, China announced the closure of the U.S. Consulate General in Chengdu on Friday.
On Saturday, U.S. consulate insignia was removed, and on Sunday, a dark-glassed car drove off the consulate amid the boos of passers-by.
On Sundays, a large number of Chengdu people gathered in front of the U.S. Consulate to take pictures, and people who had not been there were also people who were motivated by the curiosity of current events.
Agence France-Presse Chengdu station reporters also went to the United States Consulate in Chengdu to observe, sent back the news that curious people are endless, there are many parents with their children to take a walk to watch the consulate, take pictures of the building, or take selfies.
From time to time, the police were surrounded by guards, and from time to time they did not seem to allow any out-of-the-box behavior: a woman was stopped when she was just beginning to prepare to sing a red song, and a guard confiscated a banner.
However, the residents of a nearby residential building successfully pulled a giant Chinese flag on their balconies and shouted pro-China slogans.
Opened in 1985, it covers U.S. consular affairs in southwestern China, especially the Tibet Autonomous Region.
China's Chinese government's response to the U.S. has been relatively restrained: many Chinese have called online for the government to close the U.S. consulate in Hong Kong, but officials have only said that "closing the U.S. consulate in Chengdu is a necessary and legal response to unreasonable U.S. actions by the United States."
At present, in addition to Chengdu, the United States also lives in Guangdong, stationed in Shanghai, stationed in Shenyang, stationed in Wuhan, stationed in Hong Kong.
The large-scale financial media action "walking the village live to see the fight against poverty" - Today's news - Hunan Daily Network - Huasheng Online
Hunan Daily · New Hunan client July 25th (this reporter) July 25th, sponsored by the Central Radio and Television Finance Program Center's large-scale financial media action "going to the village live to see out of poverty" starting from Xuzhou, Jiangsu, two caravans with 5G new media mobile cloud broadcasting system at the scene of the guests, slowly appeared.
General Secretary Xi Jinping pointed out: "2020 is a landmark year, we will build a well-off society in an all-round way to achieve the goal of the first centenary struggle, 2020 is also the year of decisive victory in the fight against poverty."
The large-scale financial media action "walking the village to see poverty alleviation" is an important measure to do a good job in the promotion of poverty alleviation in line with this major theme.
The action will enter more than 20 provinces, autonomous regions and municipalities directly under the central government's poverty-stricken villages across the country, excavating the story of living poverty alleviation, directly attacking the great changes in the appearance of the village, and showing how the villagers can break through the dilemma of survival and development and move towards the road to wealth.
The operation will continue for more than three months.
The reporter started from Xuzhou, the soldiers were divided into two roads, all the way to the southwest line, passing through Anhui, Hubei, Jiangxi, Hunan, Guangxi, Guizhou, Sichuan, Chongqing, Yunnan, Tibet and other places; the other way to the northwest line, through Henan, Shaanxi, Gansu, Qinghai, Xinjiang, Ningxia, Inner Mongolia, Shanxi, Hebei and other places, the journey of more than 10,000 kilometers.
In the form of the report, "walking the village live to see out of poverty" bold integration.
The economic development of the caravan to the village will be aired through the Central Radio and Television Central Radio and Television Central Television Finance Channel, the Central Wide Economic Voice, the China Transport Radio, and the new financial and new media of the Central Television.
Among them, the live TV broadcast will be mainly in the CCTV financial channel's midday news program "the world's finance" to be completed (first broadcast time: Monday to Sunday 12:00-13:00), CCTV financial channel's golden news column "economic information broadcast" will open a poverty alleviation report column (first broadcast time: Monday to Sunday 20:30-21:30).
At the same time, the caravan will conduct up to 1-hour live broadcast on the CCTV financial client for each village, and the audience can watch the live broadcast and participate in the raffle by downloading the CCTV financial APP.
In terms of technical application and studio design, "walking the village to see poverty alleviation" has the courage to break through and create an "out-of-field new media caravan".
The car is equipped with a 5G new media mobile cloud broadcasting system, using 5G+4K/8K+AI technology to realize the organic combination of online and offline, large and small screens, and television broadcasts.
Configured with the three-sun broadcast area, the broadcast area is converted from a container, 12 meters long, 2.55 meters wide and 3.98 meters high, the box adopts a hydraulic automatic expansion structure, and the maximum can be flipped by 120 degrees.
The broadcasting area can also be automatically expanded and the external expansion platform covers an area of more than 50 square meters, which can meet the scene requirements of most programs.
At present, Kunming Dongchuan District is already a hot summer, and more fiery than the weather is the poverty alleviation workshop next to the relocation and resettlement site.
Lu Ling, an employee of Kunming Esford Electronic Technology Co., Ltd., said, “Now, as soon as you leave the house, you enter the factory door and make money, thanks to the free vocational skills training organized by the trade union.”
Walking into the poverty alleviation workshop for the processing of electronic components in Tongdu Street in Dongchuan District, a group of busy pictures came into view.
Lu Ling, who is more than 40 years old, is a single mother who takes children alone and takes care of elderly parents.
In her most difficult time, the Dongchuan District Federation of Trade Unions to help find a way to "send charcoal in the snow."
Since 2018, Lu Ling has enjoyed housing, education, social security, employment and other support policies and subsidies issued by trade unions at all levels.
This year, her children have successfully graduated and employment, she also participated in the skills training to have a job and income at the end of April.
It is reported that the special skills training project of the Dongchuan District General Organization to help alleviate poverty is part of the skills training work of the Yunnan Federation of Trade Unions.
Combined with the characteristics and characteristics of difficult workers in the relocation and resettlement of poverty-relief relocation sites in the district, in-depth investigation and understanding of the training needs, determine the types of training jobs, and plans to train a total of 450 electricians, welders and noodles in the near future.
Recently, Li Yi, an employee of Menglian County Branch of the Agricultural Bank of Yunnan Province, wrote a sincere thank-you letter to the County Federation of Trade Unions.
In the letter, she cordially expressed her gratitude to the trade union for the golden autumn student fees from August 2013 until January 2017, helping her to complete her studies.
In 2004, Li Yi's father died in a car accident, and his mother was included in the files of difficult workers, and since then, he has been enjoying the care of the policy.
With the help of the local trade union, Li Yi successfully completed his studies.
Since 2016, there have been 3,809 rescue households through institutional protection and accurate assistance.
The success of Lu Ling's family and Li Yi is a microcosm of the Yunnan trade union's efforts to promote the relief of difficult workers.
According to the Yunnan Provincial Federation of Trade Union Law and Human Rights Protection Work Department, the province has comprehensively strengthened the dynamic management of difficult employee archives, promoted the normalization of archiving work, and promptly incorporated into the help system for difficult employees who meet the archiving conditions; broadened the application channels of difficult employees, and used WeChat to open an online application service platform for difficult employees to facilitate the timely and active declaration of difficult employees.
During the epidemic period, in order to help employees with difficulties in the archives to ease the pressure of life, Yunnan Province arranged more than 13 million yuan to send warm funds, in accordance with the standard of 2000 yuan per household for workers with difficulties at the national level and 1500 yuan per household for difficult workers at the provincial level, for more than 6000 households at the national level and more than 1,000 provincial-level difficult workers to carry out special warm and condolence activities.
At the same time, all kinds of Internet recruitment platforms, such as social and social affairs departments and Zhilian recruitment, will push recruitment information to difficult employees, and provide employment counseling, employment guidance and other services.
